    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946632
    m_Localized: Resolved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946633
    m_Localized: Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946634
    m_Localized: Danger {value}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5043701850270335003
  - m_Id: 2986946635
    m_Localized: Empty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946636
    m_Localized: An empty tile with no special effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946637
    m_Localized: Entering this tile may trigger a random event.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946638
    m_Localized: Select any tile to inspect it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946639
    m_Localized: No tile selected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946640
    m_Localized: Region {value}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5043701850270335003
  - m_Id: 2986946641
    m_Localized: Unexplored
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946642
    m_Localized: Unresolved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946643
    m_Localized: Gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946644
    m_Localized: Battle Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946645
    m_Localized: A steady, powerful attack. Its power range is higher than Light
      Strike's, making it ideal for your first clash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946646
    m_Localized: Heavy Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946647
    m_Localized: A basic attack used to demonstrate one-sided attacks and clashes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946648
    m_Localized: Light Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946649
    m_Localized: A low-threat enemy for the first tutorial battle. It only uses Light
      Strike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946650
    m_Localized: Training Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946651
    m_Localized: 'Your ally had the higher power range, making this clash favorable.


      When
      two attack dice clash, the winner destroys the losing die and deals its own
      damage. A clash can stop an enemy attack, but it can also cost you a chance
      to attack.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946652
    m_Localized: How Clashes Work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946653
    m_Localized: 'The left side lists your ally''s skills. The right side shows the
      selected skill''s details.


      Pick a skill, close the panel, then drag
      from your ally''s speed button to the enemy''s speed button.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946654
    m_Localized: Choose a Target
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946655
    m_Localized: The enemy just damaged your ally. Damage depends on the die's power.
      The higher the power, the more damage it deals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946656
    m_Localized: A One-Sided Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946657
    m_Localized: 'Let''s learn how battles work.


      Select the enemy itself
      to inspect its profile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946658
    m_Localized: Your First Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946659
    m_Localized: Now that you've inspected the enemy, select the Prepare button at
      the bottom of the screen to roll speed for both sides.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946660
    m_Localized: Get Ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946661
    m_Localized: 'The hexagon above the enemy is a speed button. The number above
      it is the speed roll.


      Each speed button is a skill slot. More buttons
      mean more actions each round. Select the enemy''s speed button to see which
      skill it''s using.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946662
    m_Localized: Read the Enemy's Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946663
    m_Localized: 'When both sides target each other, the line turns yellow and a
      clash will occur.


      Select Prepare to resolve the clash.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946664
    m_Localized: Start a Clash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946665
    m_Localized: "Skills use dice. Attack dice deal damage. Defense dice block incoming
      damage.\n\nA range such as 1\u20132 means the die rolls either 1 or 2. Close
      the skill panel, then select Prepare to resolve the attack."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946666
    m_Localized: Watch the Enemy Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946667
    m_Localized: 'You can now inspect enemies, read speed and power ranges, connect
      targets, and resolve clashes.


      You''re ready for your next battle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946668
    m_Localized: Well Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946669
    m_Localized: 'You can counter the enemy''s attack.


      Select your ally''s
      speed button to see their available skills.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946670
    m_Localized: Time to Counterattack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946671
    m_Localized: Got it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946672
    m_Localized: The upper-left panel shows your current [[DL_ActionPoints|action
      points]]. Moving to another tile costs action points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946673
    m_Localized: Action Points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946674
    m_Localized: 'Battle tiles list the attributes of the enemies stationed there.


      Check
      them before you enter so you can plan a route or prepare suitable equipment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946675
    m_Localized: Enemy Attributes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946676
    m_Localized: You've inspected the first battle tile. Select it again to enter
      the first tutorial battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946677
    m_Localized: Enter the First Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946678
    m_Localized: Map Exploration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946679
    m_Localized: The top line shows the tile's coordinates and type. A <color=#F19A86>Battle</color>
      tile starts a fight when you enter it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946680
    m_Localized: Coordinates and Type
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946681
    m_Localized: This line shows the cost to enter a tile. A new tile normally costs
      2 action points. Returning to an explored tile normally costs 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946682
    m_Localized: Movement Cost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946683
    m_Localized: 'Danger tells you how tough the enemies on this tile are. Pay attention
      before taking on a fight.


      The map has an outer ring, middle ring, inner
      ring, and core. Enemies grow more dangerous as you get closer to the boss.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946684
    m_Localized: Danger and Region
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946685
    m_Localized: The second line shows the tile's exploration status. Visit a tile
      and complete its encounter to explore and resolve it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946686
    m_Localized: Exploration Status
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946687
    m_Localized: Select the battle tile on the right to enter the tutorial battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946688
    m_Localized: Explore the Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946689
    m_Localized: Use [[DL_Money|gold]] at shops or in events to get the supplies
      you need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946690
    m_Localized: Gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946691
    m_Localized: Select any tile on the map to see its details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946692
    m_Localized: Inspect a Tile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946693
    m_Localized: Select the battle tile on the right to inspect it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946694
    m_Localized: 'This tutorial follows a fixed route of six tiles. You''ll fight
      two basic battles, buy a blueprint and materials, craft a weapon, and then
      face an elite enemy.


      Inspect each tile before deciding where to go.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946695
    m_Localized: The Tutorial Route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946696
    m_Localized: Tutorial started. Select an adjacent tile to inspect it, then select
      it again to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946697
    m_Localized: Tile details show what you'll find and what it costs to enter. Check
      them before moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946698
    m_Localized: Tile Details
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946699
    m_Localized: Let's start with the map controls. Drag to pan, and use the mouse
      wheel or a two-finger pinch to zoom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946700
    m_Localized: Welcome to DiceLand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946701
    m_Localized: Learn the basics of DiceLand, from moving across the map and fighting
      battles to managing resources and growing your party.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946702
    m_Localized: Start Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946703
    m_Localized: Start the Tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2986946704
