  - m_Id: 22781564105046
    m_Localized: Rotbloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105047
    m_Localized: "Rotbloom \xD71"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105048
    m_Localized: Flayed Disciple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105049
    m_Localized: "Flayed Disciple \xD71"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105050
    m_Localized: Blood Spore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105051
    m_Localized: "Bloodthirsty Rat \xD73"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105052
    m_Localized: Ember Moth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105053
    m_Localized: "Ember Moth \xD71"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105054
    m_Localized: "Green Slime \xD72"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105055
    m_Localized: "Lodestone \xD72"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105056
    m_Localized: "Whirl Snail \xD72"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105057
    m_Localized: Water Snowman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105058
    m_Localized: The Queen's Hunting Party
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105059
    m_Localized: Call from Beyond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105060
    m_Localized: Crimson Broodmother
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105061
    m_Localized: "Crimson Broodmother \xD71"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105062
    m_Localized: Radiant Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105063
    m_Localized: Red Lantern
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105064
    m_Localized: Tide Spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105065
    m_Localized: Chara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105066
    m_Localized: Jenny
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105067
    m_Localized: A skilled mage who excels at rhythmic bursts of heavy damage and
      flexible skill changes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105068
    m_Localized: Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105069
    m_Localized: An aggressive berserker who specializes in heavy damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105070
    m_Localized: Molly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105071
    m_Localized: A nimble assassin who excels at dealing extra damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105072
    m_Localized: Slime Mucus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105073
    m_Localized: A lump of slime. It still seems to be wriggling, ever so slightly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105074
    m_Localized: Ember Wing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105075
    m_Localized: A pair of wings burning with a flame that warms without scorching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105076
    m_Localized: Water Orb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105077
    m_Localized: A strange mass of water. What force holds it together?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105078
    m_Localized: Whirl Fluid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105079
    m_Localized: It seems to be trying to flow, even now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105080
    m_Localized: Lodestone Crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105081
    m_Localized: Hold it, and you can feel a gentle current moving across your skin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105082
    m_Localized: Clotted Spore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105083
    m_Localized: Crystals dropped by a Blood Spore. Surprisingly soft, they look
      like tiny ruby fragments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105084
    m_Localized: Surge Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105085
    m_Localized: A clear, gleaming gem. Deep within it, blue waves seem to roll without
      end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105086
    m_Localized: Blazing Wick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105087
    m_Localized: A wick that still burns. Even without its protective casing, the
      flame refuses to die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105088
    m_Localized: Iron Ore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105089
    m_Localized: Unrefined iron ore. Process it, and it can be used to forge weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105090
    m_Localized: Shadowclaw Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105091
    m_Localized: An exceptionally sharp claw, wreathed in darkness you would rather
      not examine closely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105092
    m_Localized: Hound's Bone Pendant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105093
    m_Localized: A raven bone from a hound's collar. It seems to recall the days
      the hound spent beside its master.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105094
    m_Localized: Corroded Fang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105095
    m_Localized: A rat's teeth, marked by years of gnawing and tearing flesh. Rather
      disgusting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105096
    m_Localized: Flesh Bearing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105097
    m_Localized: A bearing smeared with flesh and blood, still creaking. Its hollow
      friction echoes on and on. Is something answering from the far shore?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105098
    m_Localized: Crimson Brood Sac
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105099
    m_Localized: A crimson sac. Best not ask what is incubating inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105100
    m_Localized: Giant Green Slime Mucus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105101
    m_Localized: A little larger, and it would be another life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105102
    m_Localized: Red Slime Mucus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105103
    m_Localized: No one knows why adding a little coloring makes a slime so much
      stronger than an ordinary one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105104
    m_Localized: Frostwing Fragment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105105
    m_Localized: Apparently, Frostember Moths and Flame Moths can mate. Would their
      offspring be ice or fire?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781564105106
    m_Localized: Wire Bundle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299008
    m_Localized: A bundle of iron wire. Hammering an iron ingot into shape would
      work just as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299009
    m_Localized: Rot-Tide Marrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299010
    m_Localized: "\u201CRotting Tide Marrow Sword!\u201D For some reason, you desperately
      want to shout it out."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299011
    m_Localized: Thornrot Root
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299012
    m_Localized: It looks revolting, but tastes sweet. In fact, it's a popular ingredient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299013
    m_Localized: Heretic's Talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299014
    m_Localized: The scent of fresh blood still clings to it. You cannot understand
      why anyone would make self-mutilation an article of faith.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299015
    m_Localized: Headwind Feather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299016
    m_Localized: Feathers that grow against the wind are the strongest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299017
    m_Localized: Coffin Nail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299018
    m_Localized: Cold, damp air clings to the nail. Take care not to prick yourself
      on something so ominous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299019
    m_Localized: Bottled Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299020
    m_Localized: Tiny waves surge within a tiny bottle. Nothing inside can contain
      them anymore. What if their strength grew a thousandfold?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299021
    m_Localized: Conductive Mane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299022
    m_Localized: For some reason, this mane has a natural affinity for electricity.
      Now great clumps of it are sticking to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299023
    m_Localized: Prismatic Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299024
    m_Localized: A prism shard that reflects both its front and back. As you turn
      it, you briefly lose track of which face is glowing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299025
    m_Localized: Radiant Crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299026
    m_Localized: A crystal radiating such brilliant light that you cannot keep your
      eyes open. What could be shining so fiercely inside it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299027
    m_Localized: Wooden Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299028
    m_Localized: The simplest of weapons, well suited to beginners.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299029
    m_Localized: Iron Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299030
    m_Localized: A sword forged from refined iron. Simple, comfortable to wield,
      and effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299031
    m_Localized: Molten Iron Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299032
    m_Localized: Heat radiates from the blade, and sparks occasionally leap from
      its edge. You might want gloves until you get used to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299033
    m_Localized: Frost Iron Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299034
    m_Localized: "Cold radiates from the blade. You can feel a distinct chill through
      its grip. \u201CSo\u2026 a free refrigerator?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299035
    m_Localized: Venom Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299036
    m_Localized: "The swordsmith says the blade was merely quenched in a special
      preparation. You would rather not ask where he scraped that \u201Cspecial\u201D
      ingredient from."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299037
    m_Localized: Bloodthirst Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299038
    m_Localized: The sword remembers every wound it has made. Grip its hilt tightly,
      and you can almost feel another heartbeat against your palm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299039
    m_Localized: Dawnoath Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299040
    m_Localized: The blade leaves a fleeting streak of white light as it falls. Each
      stroke carries the weight of judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299041
    m_Localized: Ashcrown Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299042
    m_Localized: "A one-handed sword cast from black iron and red copper. Dark crimson
      cracks cover its blade like cooled lava. They flare briefly when it swings,
      and tiny sparks trail from the tip. \u201CIt buries embers in the earth and
      waits for the wind.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299043
    m_Localized: Duskoath Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299044
    m_Localized: "The blade seems steeped in night. It reflects no light, leaving
      only a brief gray-black afterimage when swung. Faded oath cords wrap the guard,
      dark dust seeping between their knots. \u201CIt asks only that you remember
      what you once betrayed.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299045
    m_Localized: Worn Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299046
    m_Localized: A chipped dagger, its edge slightly curled by years of use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299047
    m_Localized: Gale Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299048
    m_Localized: The blacksmith says this dagger is so fast it can split the wind.
      You suspect he's making that up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299049
    m_Localized: Volt Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299050
    m_Localized: A razor-sharp dagger wreathed in wandering currents. It looks especially
      swift and deadly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299051
    m_Localized: Emberkiss Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299052
    m_Localized: A dagger with an exceptionally thin blade. Narrow crimson cracks
      run along its spine like cooling coals. Its cuts flare slowly with searing
      red light before the pain truly sets in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299053
    m_Localized: Shadowrend Dagger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299054
    m_Localized: An almost weightless dagger of black silver, its blade as narrow
      as a frozen line of wind. Three tiny teal crystals sit along its spine. It
      leaves broken afterimages when swung.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299055
    m_Localized: Coffin Nail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299056
    m_Localized: A long nail pulled from a black coffin, still steeped in cold, damp
      darkness. Every thrust feels like another slow push of the target's coffin
      lid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299057
    m_Localized: "\u201CInvincible\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299058
    m_Localized: The name Man gave his own weapon. You manage to keep a straight
      face.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299059
    m_Localized: Bloodcleaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299060
    m_Localized: A great axe tempered in fire and hot blood. Man's favorite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299061
    m_Localized: Electromagnetic Cleaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299062
    m_Localized: "It looks like someone welded a mine's circuit breaker to a logging
      axe. Every swing brings the smell of something burning. \u201CIs that\u2026
      the scent of manliness?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299063
    m_Localized: Searing Griddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299064
    m_Localized: "A broad war axe repeatedly forged from black iron and slag. A crimson
      opening runs through its blade like a burned-out throat. With every downward
      swing, the opening swells and glows, as though something inside is breathing.
      \u201CSometimes fire is simply waiting for you to cut it an exit.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299065
    m_Localized: Lighthunter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299066
    m_Localized: "Its broad blade resembles a polished solar corona. Every swing
      compresses light into a straight white line. It was made to catch things that
      try to hide behind the light. \u201CLight never forgives a fleeing foe. It
      pins their shadow where they stand.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299067
    m_Localized: Worn Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299068
    m_Localized: A gift from Jenny's mother. Jenny has used it ever since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299069
    m_Localized: Frostgleam Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299070
    m_Localized: A staff radiating a deep chill, capable of wielding the magic of
      water and ice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299071
    m_Localized: Nighteater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299072
    m_Localized: A staff woven from opaque black branches and fragments of fallen
      stars. Hold it, and whispers from the distant night reach your ears. It twists
      fate before passing judgment where the darkness is deepest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299073
    m_Localized: Bramblebloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299074
    m_Localized: "Pale, withered vines form the staff. At its tip blooms a bramble
      rose that stubbornly refuses to fade. Its petals are edged in pale green. The
      faint scent seems to linger deep in the throat. \u201CWhen the last flower
      blooms, spring has no road back.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299075
    m_Localized: Lightning Rod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299076
    m_Localized: "A metal staff so slender it looks dangerous, with a curved conducting
      needle at its tip. It glimmers before the sky turns gray, as though hearing
      thunder that has yet to fall. \u201CLightning chooses the nearest place to
      land, regardless of good or evil.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299077
    m_Localized: Thunderhowl Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299078
    m_Localized: "A staff with an extraordinary affinity for electricity. It makes
      lightning easy to control, but Jenny's hair keeps sticking to it and turning
      into a tangled mess. \u201CI really need a comb\u2026\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299079
    m_Localized: World Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299080
    m_Localized: Moving to an unexplored tile has a 5% chance to cost no AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299081
    m_Localized: "\u201CI have a map. Where's the compass?\u201D \u201CHow am I supposed
      to know where to go without a compass?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299082
    m_Localized: Encroaching Darkness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299083
    m_Localized: Allies with Darkness gain +1 skill Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299084
    m_Localized: Darkness still churns within this necklace, waiting for the day
      it returns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299085
    m_Localized: A Cat's Forgiveness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299086
    m_Localized: Allies take 1 less damage from one-sided attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299087
    m_Localized: "A necklace shaped like a string of teardrops, given to you by a
      little cat. \u201CWho made this?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299088
    m_Localized: Discord
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299089
    m_Localized: "An ally's skill has Power \u22121 if it is the same as last round's
      skill, or Power +1 if it is different."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299090
    m_Localized: The feeling is difficult to describe, like a discord deep within
      the soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299091
    m_Localized: Membership Card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299092
    m_Localized: All shop items cost 30% less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299093
    m_Localized: No one knows who started the trend. Eventually, every shop began
      issuing membership cards. Even this one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299094
    m_Localized: Erfu's Lock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299095
    m_Localized: At round start, allies with Speed 1 gain 1 stack of Temporary Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299096
    m_Localized: "\u201CThe emperor imprisoned him on Mount Shushu, shackled his
      right foot, bound his hands and hair behind him, and tied him to a tree.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299097
    m_Localized: Spring Boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299098
    m_Localized: Allies with Speed 1 gain 2 stacks of Haste next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299099
    m_Localized: Those slow steps are gathering strength for a burst of speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299100
    m_Localized: Fogdown Pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299101
    m_Localized: At the start of round 1, apply 2 Temporary Weakness to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299102
    m_Localized: A palm-sized pouch of pale gray velvet, sealing away a poisonous
      mist that saps strength from the body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299103
    m_Localized: Timeweaver's Shuttle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299104
    m_Localized: At the start of each of the first 3 rounds, all allies gain 1 Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299105
    m_Localized: "\u201CWeave quickly, while there is still time.\u201D \u201CWeave
      quickly, before the midnight bell tolls.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299106
    m_Localized: "\u201CFarewell\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299107
    m_Localized: When an ally dies, surviving allies gain 1 Strength at the start
      of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299108
    m_Localized: "\u201CIn case I don't see you again, good morning, good afternoon,
      and good night.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299109
    m_Localized: Dewdrop Amber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299110
    m_Localized: At round end, heal a random injured ally for 1 HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299111
    m_Localized: Damp light settles before dawn, quietly granting one more breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299112
    m_Localized: Time-Slip Ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299113
    m_Localized: Allies take 20% less damage from enemies with lower Speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299114
    m_Localized: Time's river folds into a ring, turning again and again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299115
    m_Localized: Cloudstream Plume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299116
    m_Localized: Allies gain +1 clash Power against slower enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299117
    m_Localized: Wind brushes the feather tips. Victory is often decided before the
      blade falls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299118
    m_Localized: Spiritforge Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299119
    m_Localized: When reforging relics, randomly keep one of the relics used as materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299120
    m_Localized: If all things have spirits, then forging an object means forging
      its spirit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299121
    m_Localized: Proliferation Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299122
    m_Localized: When reforging loot, gain 1 additional random loot item of the same
      rarity with a random attribute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299123
    m_Localized: Somehow, it always produces one more unexpected creation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299124
    m_Localized: Dwarven Bangle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299125
    m_Localized: You can reforge 3 items per rest visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299126
    m_Localized: Need the best forge around? The cave dwarves have you covered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299127
    m_Localized: "\u201CHomeward Star\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299128
    m_Localized: Moving to an explored tile costs no AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299129
    m_Localized: Stars light the road behind you. As one of their own, you may return
      without paying a price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299130
    m_Localized: Unmelting Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299131
    m_Localized: Enemies with Slow count as having 1 stack of Chill during clashes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299132
    m_Localized: The lingering cold makes it ever harder for the opponent to swing
      with conviction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299133
    m_Localized: Shadow Cloak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299134
    m_Localized: Allies with Speed above 5 take 20% less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299135
    m_Localized: When footsteps become quick enough to blend into shadow, even the
      most precise blade loses its mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299136
    m_Localized: Coupon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299137
    m_Localized: Each shop purchase adds a 5% discount to your next purchase, up
      to 3 stacks. Resets when you leave the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299138
    m_Localized: Folded into the pocket with these scraps of paper are a few carefully
      calculated bargains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299139
    m_Localized: Falling Petals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299140
    m_Localized: When an enemy dies, immediately heal every ally for 2 HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299141
    m_Localized: The fallen foe's lingering warmth seeps back into the battlefield,
      becoming nourishment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299142
    m_Localized: First-Turn Carving
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299143
    m_Localized: At the start of round 1, a random ally gains 1 Temporary Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299144
    m_Localized: Its rough grain records the opening order of attack, letting the
      first cut bite a little deeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299145
    m_Localized: Frenzy Cocktail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299146
    m_Localized: Allies deal 30% more damage to enemies with at least 3 different
      statuses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299147
    m_Localized: Three colors of mist settle at the bottom of the cup. Shake them
      together, and even your reflection learns to rage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299148
    m_Localized: Hunter's Mark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299149
    m_Localized: At round start, apply 1 Temporary Mark to a random enemy. Allied
      attacks against marked enemies deal 1 additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299150
    m_Localized: A beast bites the marked spot again and again. So does a hunter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299151
    m_Localized: Undying Heart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299152
    m_Localized: Once per battle per ally, survive fatal damage at 1 HP and gain
      1 Temporary Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299153
    m_Localized: The body may perish. True death comes when the heart gives up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299154
    m_Localized: Whetstone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299155
    m_Localized: After an ally uses the same skill twice in a row, its third use
      gains +1 Power. The counter then resets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299156
    m_Localized: The blade grows deadlier with every repeated swing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299157
    m_Localized: Rusted Cleats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299158
    m_Localized: When a slower ally hits an enemy, there is a 50% chance to apply
      1 Slow at the start of the next round. Can trigger once per skill use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299159
    m_Localized: "\u201CWhy? Because it might give them tetanus?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299160
    m_Localized: Mirror Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299161
    m_Localized: After an ally takes a One-Sided Attack, apply 1 Vulnerable to the
      attacker. Can trigger once per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299162
    m_Localized: The fracture reflects only shards of a person, cutting an attacker's
      weaknesses into sharp lines of light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299163
    m_Localized: Traveler's Canteen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299164
    m_Localized: Entering an unexplored shop heals the party by 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299165
    m_Localized: Old dents cover the kettle. The water left inside is always enough
      to reach the next light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299166
    m_Localized: Frost Talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299167
    m_Localized: Allies take 10% less damage from attackers with Chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299168
    m_Localized: Cold as snow against the chest, the charm hears footsteps beneath
      the ice for its wearer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299169
    m_Localized: Charge Coil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299170
    m_Localized: Allies with Charge gain +1 minimum die Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299171
    m_Localized: Fine copper wire circles the glimmer again and again. Even in silence,
      you can hear power turning within it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299172
    m_Localized: Four-Leaf Clover
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299173
    m_Localized: After battle, each loot drop has a 25% chance to grant 1 additional
      random loot item of the same rarity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299174
    m_Localized: Tiny drops of morning dew hide in the leaf's veins, like an extra
      fold fate made without thinking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299175
    m_Localized: Martyr
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299176
    m_Localized: When an ally dies, the surviving ally with the least HP inherits
      their Speed Slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299177
    m_Localized: A broken oath still holds some warmth, entrusting its unfinished
      steps to those who follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299178
    m_Localized: Tides
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299179
    m_Localized: At the start of each odd-numbered round, all allies gain 1 Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299180
    m_Localized: An unseen moon tugs at your ankles, periodically urging everyone
      forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299181
    m_Localized: Hunger Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299182
    m_Localized: An ally who kills an enemy gains 1 stack of Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299183
    m_Localized: It beats among victory's embers, growing brighter as it swallows
      the echoes of the fallen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299184
    m_Localized: Ironwall Badge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299185
    m_Localized: Allied defense dice gain +1 maximum Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299186
    m_Localized: Scratches crowd the back of the badge. Each remembers a moment when
      its bearer refused to yield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299187
    m_Localized: Conductive Thread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299188
    m_Localized: Allies apply 1 extra stack whenever they inflict Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299189
    m_Localized: Silver wire trembles between your fingers, like a thunderstorm still
      waiting to break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299190
    m_Localized: Pathfinder's Handbook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299191
    m_Localized: Collecting a key restores AP equal to 50% of your maximum AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299192
    m_Localized: Mud and salt stain the pages. Open them, and they always reveal
      a road that has yet to be named.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299193
    m_Localized: Stalactite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299194
    m_Localized: At battle start, apply 2 stacks of Erosion to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299195
    m_Localized: Ages of dripping water condensed into a sharp fang. It still carries
      a damp echo onto the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299196
    m_Localized: Nether Tortoise Shell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299197
    m_Localized: When an ally wins a clash with a defense die, gain 1 Temporary Guard
      at the start of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299198
    m_Localized: The armor plate is heavy as the bed of a river at night. Dark ripples
      spread across it when it stops a blade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299199
    m_Localized: Dragonscale Armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299200
    m_Localized: Allies with Charge take 1 less damage per stack, up to a reduction
      of 2.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299201
    m_Localized: Each scale resembles a dying spark. Against the skin, it still holds
      an ancient warmth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299202
    m_Localized: Adaptive Vest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299203
    m_Localized: After a Calamity triggers, all allies begin the next battle with
      1 Strength and 1 Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299204
    m_Localized: The fabric remembers every impact, quietly tightening its weave
      before the next storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299205
    m_Localized: Reflection Prism
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299206
    m_Localized: When an ally takes a One-Sided Attack, deal counter damage equal
      to 50% of the damage taken, up to 10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299207
    m_Localized: The facet reflects pain back to its source, showing the attacker
      their own shattered shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299208
    m_Localized: Calamity Banner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299209
    m_Localized: When a Calamity triggers, all allies gain +4 max HP and recover
      4 HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299210
    m_Localized: The torn banner snaps in every ill wind. The closer disaster draws,
      the more its color resembles fresh blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299211
    m_Localized: Symbiotic Colony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299212
    m_Localized: When an ally dies, transfer their Haste, Strength, and Guard to
      the surviving ally with the most HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299213
    m_Localized: Fine fungal threads carry warmth between wounds, like an underground
      city sharing in silence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299214
    m_Localized: Wind and Cloud Jade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299215
    m_Localized: At the start of round 1, all allies temporarily gain 1 additional
      Speed Slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299216
    m_Localized: Wind circles within the jade ring. When the first cloud shadow falls,
      footsteps gain another echo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299217
    m_Localized: Energy Crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299218
    m_Localized: In Elite and Boss battles, recover 1 additional Energy at the start
      of every round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299219
    m_Localized: A small shard of lightning is sealed deep in the crystal. It burns
      steadily only in the most dangerous battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299220
    m_Localized: Liquefied Fuel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299221
    m_Localized: At round start, enemy Burn stacks decay by 25% instead of half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299222
    m_Localized: Even in the cold, the fire oil slowly churns within its glass jar,
      like an ember unwilling to fade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299223
    m_Localized: Flint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299224
    m_Localized: At round start, apply 1 Burn to the enemy with the least HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299225
    m_Localized: Tiny cracks cover the stone. A light scrape sends sparks dancing
      between your fingers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299226
    m_Localized: Hearth Ash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299227
    m_Localized: The first time you damage an enemy each round, apply 1 additional
      Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299228
    m_Localized: Glints of red hide beneath the cold ash, ready to kindle at the
      first breath of wind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299229
    m_Localized: Volatile Jar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299230
    m_Localized: The first time each enemy reaches at least 5 Burn in a battle, immediately
      trigger its Burn damage without reducing its stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299231
    m_Localized: Smoke has stained the jar a dark crimson. One shake is all the heat
      inside needs to burst free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299232
    m_Localized: Charred Tinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299233
    m_Localized: At round start, each enemy with Burn has a 50% chance to gain 1
      additional Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299234
    m_Localized: A charred tuft rests in your palm. Its lingering heat seeks something
      new to burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299235
    m_Localized: Flame Cloak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299236
    m_Localized: When an ally takes a One-Sided Attack, apply 1 Burn to the attacker.
      Can trigger twice per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299237
    m_Localized: Fine threads of fire line the cloak. Any blade that parts the fabric
      first meets a wave of heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299238
    m_Localized: Tempered Scabbard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299239
    m_Localized: Allies gain +1 clash Power against enemies with at least 4 Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299240
    m_Localized: The scabbard's edge is always warm. Draw the sword, and it gathers
      the enemy's flames along the blade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299241
    m_Localized: Wax Heart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299242
    m_Localized: When an ally's skill applies Burn to an enemy, that ally recovers
      1 HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299243
    m_Localized: A heart of fire beats slowly inside translucent wax. The fiercer
      the burning, the gentler its glow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299244
    m_Localized: Flame Boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299245
    m_Localized: At round start, if at least 2 combatants have Burn, all allies gain
      1 Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299246
    m_Localized: Tiny flame vents line the soles. The hotter the battlefield, the
      lighter your steps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299247
    m_Localized: Crimson Lotus Pact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299248
    m_Localized: When an enemy dies, its Burn transfers to the remaining enemy with
      the least HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299249
    m_Localized: A red lotus blooms on the contract. As its petals fall, the debt
      of fire passes to the next name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299250
    m_Localized: Blazing Chalice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299251
    m_Localized: Allies heal for 1 HP when they damage an enemy with Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299252
    m_Localized: A golden tongue of flame circles the inside of the empty cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299253
    m_Localized: "\u201CPhoenix\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299254
    m_Localized: When an ally would take fatal damage, if enemies have more than
      5 Burn in total, prevent that damage by consuming the corresponding Burn stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299255
    m_Localized: A black feather turns within the fire. Before its ashes reach the
      ground, new light has already begun to grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299256
    m_Localized: Eternal Flame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299257
    m_Localized: Enemy Burn cannot drop below 2 stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299258
    m_Localized: It simply keeps burning until everything is consumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299259
    m_Localized: The Girl's Matches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299260
    m_Localized: At battle start, apply 1 stack of Burn to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299261
    m_Localized: "\u201CHello, sir.\u201D \u201CWould you like a match?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299262
    m_Localized: Charcoal Pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299263
    m_Localized: When an ally applies Burn to an enemy, there is a 25% chance to
      apply the same amount of Burn to another random enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299264
    m_Localized: Loosen the bag's mouth, and black powder drifts on the rising heat
      to settle in more distant wounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299265
    m_Localized: Dry Kindling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299266
    m_Localized: When an ally applies Burn to an enemy, there is a 25% chance to
      apply that amount of Burn to the target again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299267
    m_Localized: These dry, cracked branches are waiting for a single spark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299268
    m_Localized: Frosttide Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299269
    m_Localized: At round start, enemies with Chill gain Vulnerable equal to their
      Chill stack count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299270
    m_Localized: Tidal traces cling to the stone. Its chill rests against the skin
      like water that can never fully recede.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299271
    m_Localized: Snowbell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299272
    m_Localized: At battle start, apply 2 stacks of Chill to 1 random enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299273
    m_Localized: A flake of snow is sealed inside the bell's clapper. When it rings,
      only a faint white sound remains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299274
    m_Localized: Freezing Solution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299275
    m_Localized: At round start, enemies with at least 5 Erosion gain 1 Chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299276
    m_Localized: The liquid in the bottle stays still, slowly forming clear frost
      only when brought near a wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299277
    m_Localized: Frostbite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299278
    m_Localized: At round end, enemies take damage equal to their Chill stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299279
    m_Localized: Cold first leaves tiny cracks between the bones. Death comes later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299280
    m_Localized: Winter in a Dream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299281
    m_Localized: When an ally clashes with an enemy that has Chill, their skill dice
      gain +1 minimum Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299282
    m_Localized: Someone dreamed an entire winter. Ever since waking, their every
      strike has been steadier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299283
    m_Localized: Glacier Pact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299284
    m_Localized: At round end, recover additional Energy equal to half the total
      Chill on enemies, rounded down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299285
    m_Localized: The contract's writing appears in the cold, like a frozen river
      that is still slowly moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299286
    m_Localized: "Water at \u221267\xB0C"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299287
    m_Localized: At round start, apply 1 Erosion to the enemy with the highest HP
      percentage and 1 Chill to the enemy with the lowest HP percentage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299288
    m_Localized: Still water, cold enough to forget that it once flowed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299289
    m_Localized: Ice Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299290
    m_Localized: The first time each round you damage a target with Chill, apply
      2 additional Vulnerable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299291
    m_Localized: The thin blade follows the ice's most fragile seams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299292
    m_Localized: Surge Accelerator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299293
    m_Localized: Enemy Erosion grants 2 stacks of Vulnerable each round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299294
    m_Localized: It compresses the tide again and again, until nothing can contain
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299295
    m_Localized: Fire in Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299296
    m_Localized: When Burn deals damage to an enemy that also has Chill, deal one
      additional instance of damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299297
    m_Localized: Fire waits within the ice, still alive, for the instant it cracks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299298
    m_Localized: Icebreaker Tongs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299299
    m_Localized: Allies gain +1 dice Power when clashing with enemies that have at
      least 3 Chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299300
    m_Localized: The jaws close without a sound. Only the ice is forced to admit
      where it can break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299301
    m_Localized: Acidifier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299302
    m_Localized: Allies deal +1 damage to targets with at least 3 stacks of Erosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299303
    m_Localized: The powder dissolves in water without color or scent, softening
      armor from within.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299304
    m_Localized: Thermal Suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299305
    m_Localized: Allies are immune to Chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299306
    m_Localized: Fine currents of heat run through the cloth. However cold the world
      becomes, a little spring remains against the heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299307
    m_Localized: Upstream Sail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299308
    m_Localized: At round start, if any enemy has at least 2 Erosion, the slowest
      ally gains 1 Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299309
    m_Localized: The sail draws its motion from the tide retreating beneath the enemy's
      feet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299310
    m_Localized: Ebbtide Talisman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299311
    m_Localized: Enemies with Erosion deal 1 less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299312
    m_Localized: A shell left behind by the ebbing tide rests within the charm. It
      carries a little of each incoming blow away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299313
    m_Localized: Roaring Tide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299314
    m_Localized: Each stack of Erosion on an enemy counts as 5 extra stacks of Vulnerable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299315
    m_Localized: The sea's voice is sealed inside a thin shell fragment, amplifying
      every crack in an enemy with its waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299316
    m_Localized: Ancient Coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299317
    m_Localized: On pickup, gain 70 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299318
    m_Localized: The worn old coin is still heavy, as though it bears the weight
      of some distant spire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299319
    m_Localized: Blue Bull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299320
    m_Localized: At the start of round 3, gain 5 Energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299321
    m_Localized: A little bull figurine painted blue. Definitely blue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299322
    m_Localized: Strawberry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299323
    m_Localized: Allies gain +3 max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299324
    m_Localized: Yes. That's exactly the flavor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299325
    m_Localized: Horseshoe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299326
    m_Localized: After victory, at least one defeated enemy's loot will drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299327
    m_Localized: Scratches cover its iron face. Somehow, it always manages to nail
      a little luck to the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299328
    m_Localized: Hoarding Permit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299329
    m_Localized: Shops always stock 9 items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299330
    m_Localized: A permit covered in stamps, allowing merchants to display things
      they really shouldn't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299331
    m_Localized: "\u201COnce More!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299332
    m_Localized: You can reroll relic bag rewards once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299333
    m_Localized: A scrap of paper bears a scrawled message, written with the absolute
      conviction that fate owes you a reroll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299334
    m_Localized: Piggy Bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299335
    m_Localized: Whenever you spend AP, gain 3 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299336
    m_Localized: Coins always jingle inside the pink ceramic pig. Carry it, and every
      step seems to shake loose a little change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299337
    m_Localized: IOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299338
    m_Localized: You can buy any item as long as you have more than 0 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299339
    m_Localized: An IOU with no repayment date. The frightening part is that merchants
      actually accept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299340
    m_Localized: Statue of Pride
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299341
    m_Localized: At round start, allies at full HP gain 1 Temporary Strength and
      1 Temporary Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299342
    m_Localized: The statue holds its head high. Only those entirely unscathed deserve
      its praise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299343
    m_Localized: Statue of Doubt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299344
    m_Localized: At round start, allies below 20% HP gain 1 Temporary Strength and
      1 Temporary Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299345
    m_Localized: The statue bows its head, offering a little defiance only at the
      brink of breaking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299346
    m_Localized: Horn of Fortune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299347
    m_Localized: At the start of round 1, allies gain 1 stack of Luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299348
    m_Localized: A horn that brings good fortune and lifts everyone's spirits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299349
    m_Localized: "\u201CCollapse\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299350
    m_Localized: When an ally dies, all enemies gain 3 stacks of Stun next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299351
    m_Localized: Like the collapse of a star.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299352
    m_Localized: Medium Parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299353
    m_Localized: On pickup, gain 2 random relics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299354
    m_Localized: "\u201CExcuse me, sir. This one is actually\u2014\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299355
    m_Localized: Large Parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299356
    m_Localized: On pickup, gain 3 random relics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299357
    m_Localized: "\u201CI'll take the medium parcel.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299358
    m_Localized: Oversized Parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299359
    m_Localized: On pickup, gain 5 random relics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299360
    m_Localized: "\u201CMedium, large, and _ _ _!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299361
    m_Localized: Venom-Eater Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299362
    m_Localized: When an ally loses a clash against a target with Poison, gain 1
      Shield at the start of the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299363
    m_Localized: This shield devours an opponent's poison and turns it into hardness
      of its own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299364
    m_Localized: Energy Sleeping Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299365
    m_Localized: At battle start, max Energy +5.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299366
    m_Localized: Get a good night's sleep. A rested fighter can bring their full
      strength to battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299367
    m_Localized: Silver Coin of Hope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299368
    m_Localized: Gain an extra 40 gold when you restore AP at a rest tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299369
    m_Localized: Silver Coin of Exploration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299370
    m_Localized: Gain an extra 20 gold when you reforge items at a rest tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299371
    m_Localized: Silver Coin of Peace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299372
    m_Localized: Gain an extra 40 gold when you restore HP at a rest tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299373
    m_Localized: Signpost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299374
    m_Localized: Moving to an unexplored rest tile costs no AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299375
    m_Localized: Moon in Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299376
    m_Localized: At the start of round 3, gain 10 temporary Energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299377
    m_Localized: Beautiful, and gone in an instant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299378
    m_Localized: Flower in the Mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299379
    m_Localized: Gain 1 temporary Energy each round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299380
    m_Localized: A mirror that reflects a single flower. Wherever you point it, that
      same flower fills the glass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299381
    m_Localized: No Self
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299382
    m_Localized: When an ally uses a temporary skill added during battle, gain 3
      additional Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299383
    m_Localized: Others are not me, and even I am without a self.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299384
    m_Localized: Rebirth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299385
    m_Localized: Once per run, a battle defeat returns you to the map and fully restores
      the party's HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299386
    m_Localized: Forbidden Knowledge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299387
    m_Localized: Battle XP is reduced by 50%. After battle, all allies recover 30%
      of their missing HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299388
    m_Localized: Severed Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299389
    m_Localized: At battle start, temporarily summon a puppet that can act independently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299390
    m_Localized: A battered little puppet. It seems determined to stick with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299391
    m_Localized: Trick Dice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299392
    m_Localized: When an ally's skill die rolls its minimum value, that ally's skill
      dice gain +1 minimum Power next round. Can trigger once per ally per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299393
    m_Localized: Trash Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299394
    m_Localized: It reeks. How could this possibly be useful?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299395
    m_Localized: Golden Trash Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299396
    m_Localized: At battle start, all allies gain 2 Strength, 2 Guard, 2 Haste, 2
      Luck, and 2 Resistance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299397
    m_Localized: Dimensional Healing Vial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299398
    m_Localized: After a battle in a special dungeon, all allies recover 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299399
    m_Localized: Potent Venom Tonic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299400
    m_Localized: When an ally loses a clash against a target with Poison, apply 1
      Poison to that target next round. Can trigger once per enemy per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299401
    m_Localized: Every medicine carries some poison, but this seems to be taking
      it too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299402
    m_Localized: "\u201CDisease\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299403
    m_Localized: Targets with Poison deal 10% less damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299404
    m_Localized: Illness saps your strength. The contents of this file alone could
      leave someone exhausted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299405
    m_Localized: "\u201CPlague\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299406
    m_Localized: When an enemy with Poison dies, apply its Poison stack count to
      every remaining enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299407
    m_Localized: Sometimes the fear of falling ill is more frightening than the disease
      itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299408
    m_Localized: Refined Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299409
    m_Localized: When an enemy reaches 2 Poison, immediately deal 2 damage to it.
      Can trigger once per enemy per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299410
    m_Localized: Poison is poisonous enough already. What exactly is refined poison
      for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299411
    m_Localized: Priming Dose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299412
    m_Localized: Skill effects that apply Poison on hit apply it on use instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299413
    m_Localized: The finest medicine in the world. Its effects begin the moment you
      lay eyes on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299414
    m_Localized: Chronic Poisoning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299415
    m_Localized: At round end, Poison loses 50% of its stacks, rounded down, instead
      of losing all of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299416
    m_Localized: "Anyone who loses their attachment to life has usually suffered
      for a very, very long time\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299417
    m_Localized: Venom Needle Seal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299418
    m_Localized: At battle start, apply 2 stacks of Poison to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299419
    m_Localized: Whoever invented this sealing wax was playing dirty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299420
    m_Localized: Bitterroot Pouch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299421
    m_Localized: When an ally clashes with a target that has Poison, their skill
      dice gain +1 maximum Power. Can trigger once per ally per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299422
    m_Localized: Good medicine tastes bitter. A whole pouch of bitter roots must
      be very good indeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299423
    m_Localized: Dregs of Medicine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299424
    m_Localized: When an enemy with Poison dies, a random ally below full HP recovers
      3 HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299425
    m_Localized: The dregs left after extracting some unknown medicine. Nobody wants
      them, so help yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299426
    m_Localized: Venom Sac Charm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299427
    m_Localized: When an ally takes damage from an enemy with Poison, deal damage
      back to that enemy equal to its Poison stack count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299428
    m_Localized: A small venom sac you can carry as a last means of self-defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781568299429
    m_Localized: Verdigris Etching Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493312
    m_Localized: Allies deal +1 damage to targets with at least 2 stacks of Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493313
    m_Localized: A carving knife coated in venom. The sharp pain makes the toxin
      act even faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493314
    m_Localized: Pathology Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493315
    m_Localized: Allies deal 20% more damage to targets with Poison. This bonus increases
      to 40% against targets with at least 3 Poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493316
    m_Localized: A detailed medical handbook covering many known illnesses. It also
      explains how to make those illnesses worse. Was the author quite all right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493317
    m_Localized: Contagion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493318
    m_Localized: When an enemy with Poison wins a clash, it gains 1 additional Poison.
      Can trigger once per enemy per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493319
    m_Localized: Disease spreads, and life slips away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493320
    m_Localized: Bramblebloom Bed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493321
    m_Localized: At round end, if all living enemies have Poison, preserve at least
      1 Poison on them into the next round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493322
    m_Localized: It turns the body into the perfect breeding ground for suffering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493323
    m_Localized: Beyond Cure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493324
    m_Localized: Enemies with Poison cannot heal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493325
    m_Localized: "\u201CIncurable\u201D is the highest praise a disease can receive."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493326
    m_Localized: Soulcall Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493327
    m_Localized: Once per battle, when an ally would die, transfer half the HP of
      the ally with the highest HP percentage to save them. If any enemy has at least
      2 Poison, the saved ally also gains 1 Strength and 1 Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493328
    m_Localized: The panacea everyone dreams of finding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493329
    m_Localized: Relay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493330
    m_Localized: Shock Bursts consume 50% of Shock stacks instead of all stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493331
    m_Localized: A little device burned through and repaired over and over. Tiny
      sparks crackle inside its casing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493332
    m_Localized: Solenoid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493333
    m_Localized: Enemy Shock cannot drop below 1 stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493334
    m_Localized: A current circles endlessly through this short coil.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493335
    m_Localized: Conductive Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493336
    m_Localized: "When an ally damages a target with Shock, there is a 10% chance
      to trigger a 1\xD7 Shock Burst without consuming stacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493337
    m_Localized: A blade made specifically to cut through electricity. Is it magic,
      or technology?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493338
    m_Localized: Electromagnetic Accelerator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493339
    m_Localized: Allies with Shock count as having 1 stack of Haste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493340
    m_Localized: It makes your body believe that the next step has already happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493341
    m_Localized: "\u201CSurge Circuit\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493342
    m_Localized: When an ally triggers a Shock Burst on an enemy, deal half its damage
      to every other enemy. If there are no other enemies, deal an additional 50%
      Shock damage to the original target instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493343
    m_Localized: Tap it, and a current returns from a direction that should not exist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493344
    m_Localized: Conductive Jumper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493345
    m_Localized: Allies with Shock apply 1 stack of Shock when they damage a target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493346
    m_Localized: It looks useless, yet always manages to reconnect something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493347
    m_Localized: "\u201CHidden Lightning\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493348
    m_Localized: When an ally damages a target with Shock, there is a 30% chance
      to deal 2 additional damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493349
    m_Localized: Lightning has been buried inside it all along. Nobody knew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493350
    m_Localized: Faraday Cage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493351
    m_Localized: Allies take 10% less damage from attackers with Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493352
    m_Localized: You feel especially safe inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493353
    m_Localized: High-Voltage Spike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493354
    m_Localized: Allies gain +1 clash Power against targets with Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493355
    m_Localized: A slender platinum spike. Its surface is covered in scorch marks
      instead of blood grooves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493356
    m_Localized: "\u201CLightning Strike\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493357
    m_Localized: At round end, deal 10 damage to every enemy with at least 10 Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493358
    m_Localized: The crackling current is only a warning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493359
    m_Localized: Threshold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493360
    m_Localized: When an ally triggers a Shock Burst that deals at least 5 damage,
      that ally gains 1 Temporary Strength next round, and each of their attacks
      applies 2 additional Shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493361
    m_Localized: Soon you'll discover what happens when a current exceeds its threshold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493362
    m_Localized: Heartguard Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493363
    m_Localized: After acquiring this relic, all allies start the next battle with
      10 Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493364
    m_Localized: Hold it against your chest, and you can hear your heartbeat gradually
      settle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493365
    m_Localized: Cardiac Resonance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493366
    m_Localized: At round start, if all living allies have Shock, all allies gain
      1 Temporary Strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493367
    m_Localized: It makes every heartbeat feel less lonely, and a little less safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493368
    m_Localized: Shock Burst Shield
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493369
    m_Localized: When an ally deals Shock Burst damage, gain Shield equal to the
      damage dealt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493370
    m_Localized: It gathers the scattered embers and forges harm into a line of defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493371
    m_Localized: "\u201CMind the Flame\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493372
    m_Localized: When an ally deals Shock Burst damage, deal 3 additional damage
      if the target also has Burn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493373
    m_Localized: Someone's final earnest warning before the accident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493374
    m_Localized: Pacemaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493375
    m_Localized: Once per battle per ally, consume 5 of their Shock to survive fatal
      damage and gain 1 Immunity for the current round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493376
    m_Localized: "\u201CIf only my heart could beat just once more when I fall.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493377
    m_Localized: Stocking Permit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493378
    m_Localized: Shops stock at least 7 items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493379
    m_Localized: With nothing but this thin certificate, merchants have earned thousands
      in gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493380
    m_Localized: Energy Insurance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493381
    m_Localized: Losing a clash with a skill that costs Energy refunds 1 Energy.
      Can trigger once per skill per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493382
    m_Localized: Sometimes the reward falls short of the effort. At least this gets
      a little of your investment back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493383
    m_Localized: Driver's License
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493384
    m_Localized: At round start, set the slowest ally's Speed equal to the highest
      Speed among allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493385
    m_Localized: Someone's driver's license, carelessly shoved into your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493386
    m_Localized: Riposte Spike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493387
    m_Localized: When an ally wins a clash with a defense die, gain 1 Temporary Strength
      next round. Can trigger once per ally per round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493388
    m_Localized: Waiting for an opponent to run into you is a perfectly valid hunting
      strategy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493389
    m_Localized: Shield Spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493390
    m_Localized: At round start, the ally with the lowest HP gains 1 stack of Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493391
    m_Localized: It looks like a shield. In fact, it's a little spirit shaped like
      one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493392
    m_Localized: "\u201CShield Retort\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493393
    m_Localized: When an ally loses Shield stacks, a random enemy loses the same
      amount of HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493394
    m_Localized: Defense is the best offense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493395
    m_Localized: Armor Polish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493396
    m_Localized: At battle start, the ally with the lowest HP gains 2 stacks of Shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493397
    m_Localized: The sort of practical item an adventurer tosses into their pack
      without a second thought.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493398
    m_Localized: "\u201CA Sense of Safety\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493399
    m_Localized: Allies with Shield gain +1 minimum defense die Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493400
    m_Localized: Everyone needs to feel protected sometimes, even by something as
      simple as a blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493401
    m_Localized: The Heir's Bequest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493402
    m_Localized: On pickup, gain 200 Gold, 3 random relics, and 3 random blueprints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493403
    m_Localized: The final fortune of a kingdom, an inheritance that should never
      have passed to anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493404
    m_Localized: Wayfarer's Boots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493405
    m_Localized: Allows diagonal movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493406
    m_Localized: True fleetness means stepping beyond the rules themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493407
    m_Localized: Final Farewell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493408
    m_Localized: Lose every party member except your starting character and disable
      recruitment. Party members gain +20 max HP. At battle start, allies gain 3
      Strength and 3 Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493409
    m_Localized: Farewell forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493410
    m_Localized: Fortune Tonic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493411
    m_Localized: At round start, each living ally independently has a 25% chance
      to gain 1 Luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493412
    m_Localized: An elixir many people dream of. Use it sparingly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493413
    m_Localized: Opening Blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493414
    m_Localized: The first damage dealt to an enemy each battle is increased by 100%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493415
    m_Localized: Two good whacks, out of nowhere!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493416
    m_Localized: New World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493417
    m_Localized: Lose all keys and regenerate every tile except your current tile
      and the Boss tile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493418
    m_Localized: Heaven ahead, or hell? The only way to know is to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493419
    m_Localized: Yin Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493420
    m_Localized: Has no combat effect. Reforge it with Yang Fish at a rest tile to
      always obtain Yin-Yang Fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493421
    m_Localized: "Drifting\u2026 drifting\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493422
    m_Localized: Yang Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493423
    m_Localized: Has no combat effect. Reforge it with Yin Fish at a rest tile to
      always obtain Yin-Yang Fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493424
    m_Localized: "Swimming\u2026 swimming\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493425
    m_Localized: Shattertide Salt Bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493426
    m_Localized: Enemies no longer receive Erosion. Each application of Erosion applies
      15 Vulnerable instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493427
    m_Localized: The tide left no trace, but its salt cracked the armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493428
    m_Localized: Hidden Reef
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493429
    m_Localized: At round start, apply 1 stack of Slow to each enemy with Erosion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493430
