    m_Localized: "Exploration \xB7 Lost Rest Stops"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493498
    m_Localized: Two unexplored rest tiles become normal battle tiles for their regions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493499
    m_Localized: "Party \xB7 Shallow Rest"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493500
    m_Localized: Restoring AP at a rest tile restores 70% of max AP instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493501
    m_Localized: "Enemies \xB7 Speed I"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493502
    m_Localized: All enemies gain +1 Speed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493503
