  - m_Id: 22781572493541
    m_Localized: The Whispering Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493542
    m_Localized: On the night before a village closes, you escort an echo restorer
      to an old well to investigate a whisper that only the living can hear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493543
    m_Localized: The Recurring Door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493544
    m_Localized: "The Heir\u2019s Revenge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493545
    m_Localized: A crown prince's diary lies sealed inside an old castle. Drawn into
      a distorted version of history, you must uncover his true last wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493546
    m_Localized: Labyrinth of Luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493547
    m_Localized: A maze said to embody luck. Those who find their way out are rumored
      to receive great rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493548
    m_Localized: Bleed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493549
    m_Localized: When attacked, take damage equal to the Bleed stack count, then
      halve the stacks, rounded down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493550
    m_Localized: Burn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
