    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493605
    m_Localized: Speed increases by the number of stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493606
    m_Localized: Mark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493607
    m_Localized: Enemies may focus their attacks on this target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493608
    m_Localized: Temporary Mark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493609
    m_Localized: May draw concentrated attacks. All stacks are lost at round end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493610
    m_Localized: Vulnerable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493611
    m_Localized: Take 1% more damage per stack. Actual damage is rounded down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493612
    m_Localized: Weakness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493613
    m_Localized: Attack die Power decreases by the number of stacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493614
    m_Localized: Temporary Weakness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493615
    m_Localized: Attack dice lose Power equal to the stack count. All stacks are
      lost at round end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493616
    m_Localized: Temporary Weakness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493617
    m_Localized: Attack dice lose Power equal to the stack count. All stacks are
      lost at round end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493618
    m_Localized: Blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493619
    m_Localized: Dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493620
    m_Localized: Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493621
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493622
    m_Localized: Light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493623
    m_Localized: Neutral
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493624
    m_Localized: Poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493625
    m_Localized: Speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493626
    m_Localized: Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493627
    m_Localized: Glowing Tree Hollow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493628
    m_Localized: "A glowing hollow in a dead tree catches your eye. Peering inside,
      you discover a cluster of faintly luminous worms.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493629
    m_Localized: Reach Inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493630
    m_Localized: Heal every party member by 20% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493631
    m_Localized: You reach into the hollow. The worms crumble into glowing dust the
      moment you touch them. To your amazement, every cut on your hand has vanished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493632
    m_Localized: Poke with a Weapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493633
    m_Localized: "The party loses 15% HP and gains 2\u20133 common loot items."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493634
    m_Localized: You probe the hollow with your weapon. Sensing danger, the worms
      spray a little venom at you and scatter. After awkwardly wiping it off, you
      discover several pieces of loot where they had been huddled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493635
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493636
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP. Nothing else happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493637
    m_Localized: You decide to leave the little creatures in peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493638
    m_Localized: Abandoned Mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493639
    m_Localized: "You discover an abandoned mine. Its winding tunnels disappear into
      the darkness.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493640
    m_Localized: Explore Deeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493641
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle. Win to receive a special relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493642
    m_Localized: 'You venture deeper into the mine.

      At first, it is only a
      patch of darkness. Then a mass. A shape.

      Then it is standing in front
      of you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493643
    m_Localized: Search the Shallow Tunnels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493644
    m_Localized: Gain 1 Iron Ore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493645
    m_Localized: You search the mine's shallow tunnels. Your keen eyes spot a few
      pieces of iron ore that someone left behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493646
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493647
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493648
    m_Localized: There is a long road ahead. Better save your strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493649
    m_Localized: Wandering Bard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493650
    m_Localized: "You meet a bard by the roadside. He greets you with a song and
      strikes up a lively conversation. After a while, he leans closer and asks,
      \u201CCare to buy something thrilling?\u201D\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493651
    m_Localized: Pay with Gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493652
    m_Localized: Pay 10 gold for 1 random blueprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493653
    m_Localized: "Once you pay, he pulls a ragged piece of parchment from his coat
      and hands it to you. \u201CHa ha ha! Excellent! Excellent!\u201D Still laughing,
      he drifts away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493654
    m_Localized: Trade Some Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493655
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493656
    m_Localized: He thanks you, then takes a parcel from his coat and hands it over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493657
    m_Localized: Talking Mushroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493658
    m_Localized: "A small, childlike voice calls out as you travel. You search for
      its source and discover a brightly colored mushroom. Crouching down, you listen
      closely.\n\u201CHello! Hello! I'm a magic mushroom! I can grant your wish!\u201D\nYou
      decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493659
    m_Localized: Wish for Wealth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493660
    m_Localized: "Gain 10\u201320 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493661
    m_Localized: "You wish for lots and lots of money.\n\u201CI'm only a little mushroom,
      so I'm not very rich. But I can give you everything I have! Dig beneath your
      feet!\u201D\nYou dig into the soil and find a pile of gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493662
    m_Localized: Wish for Loot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493663
    m_Localized: "Gain 1\u20132 pieces of [[DL_Attribute_Poison|Poison]] loot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493664
    m_Localized: "You wish for some loot.\n\u201CUp in the tree! In the tree!\u201D\nYou
      climb up\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493665
    m_Localized: Wish for More Wishes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493666
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493667
    m_Localized: "You wish for more wishes.\n\u201COh\u2026 but I don't have that
      much magic,\u201D the little mushroom says, crestfallen.\n\u201CStill, I can
      try!\u201D\nIt trembles with effort. The colors slowly fade from its cap.\n\u201C\u2014\u201D\nThe
      mushroom falls still. It seems to have withered away.\nYou receive nothing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493668
    m_Localized: Floating Soul Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493669
    m_Localized: "You notice something floating in the air. On closer inspection,
      it seems to be translucent.\nAs you study it, it speaks. \u201CWhat are you
      staring at? Never seen a soul before?\u201D\nYou ask how it ended up like this.\n\u201CWhat
      do you mean, how? This is just how I am. Look, could you help me pass on? I'm
      stuck here.\u201D\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493670
    m_Localized: Help the Soul Pass On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493671
    m_Localized: The party gains 10 XP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493672
    m_Localized: "\u201COh\u2026 at last, I'm free\u2026\u201D\nYou help the soul
      pass on and feel your own spirit uplifted.\nThe party gains 10 XP."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493673
    m_Localized: Absorb the Soul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493674
    m_Localized: Gain a special relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493675
    m_Localized: "\u201CWhat are you doing? No!\u201D\nThe soul's voice grows fainter
      as you absorb it completely.\nYou feel it merging with your own soul until
      the two become one.\nBut\u2026 is that a good thing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493676
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493677
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493678
    m_Localized: You leave the rude soul shouting behind you and walk away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493679
    m_Localized: Little Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493680
    m_Localized: "A little cat by the roadside keeps hissing at you.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493681
    m_Localized: Feed the Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493682
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493683
    m_Localized: "You feed yourself to the cat\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493684
    m_Localized: Pet the Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493685
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493686
    m_Localized: The cat attacks you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493687
    m_Localized: Meow at the Cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493688
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493689
    m_Localized: 'You seem to have established a way to communicate. Does it think
      you''re another cat?

      It shares some of its savings with you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493690
    m_Localized: Frenzied Rat Pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493691
    m_Localized: "Disaster! A vast horde of rodents surges toward you.\nWith danger
      closing in, you decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493692
    m_Localized: Face Them Head-On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493693
    m_Localized: Enter a battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493694
    m_Localized: You brace yourself and face them head-on, hoping to escape with
      as few bites as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493695
    m_Localized: Distract Them with Food
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493696
    m_Localized: Discard loot from your inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493697
    m_Localized: 'Thinking quickly, you toss out the food in your pack. Food to them,
      anyway.

      You slip away unharmed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493698
    m_Localized: Flee in a Panic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493699
    m_Localized: The party loses 20% of max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493700
    m_Localized: You run wildly in every direction. You narrowly avoid being stripped
      to the bone, but collect plenty of bites along the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493701
    m_Localized: Spike Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493702
    m_Localized: "The ground gives way beneath your feet. Its false surface falls
      apart, revealing rows of gleaming spikes directly below you.\nThinking fast,
      you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493703
    m_Localized: Leap to Safety
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493704
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493705
    m_Localized: Your quick, nimble reaction gets you out of danger. Even so, your
      heart keeps pounding long after you are safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493706
    m_Localized: Grab the Rock Wall to Break Your Fall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493707
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and 20% party HP. Gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493708
    m_Localized: Your quick, nimble reaction gets you out of danger. Even so, your
      heart keeps pounding long after you are safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493709
    m_Localized: Roadside Clay Jar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493710
    m_Localized: Several old clay pots lie half-buried beside the road. A faint golden
      glow seeps from their mouths, as though something is hidden inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493711
    m_Localized: Smash a Pot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493712
    m_Localized: "Gain 8\u201316 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493713
    m_Localized: You smash a pot open. Sure enough, gleaming gold spills out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493714
    m_Localized: Carefully Dig It Out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493715
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and gain a random blueprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493716
    m_Localized: You carefully dig out the pot and empty it. Inside is a weapon blueprint.
      You put it away for safekeeping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493717
    m_Localized: Dig Deeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493718
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP and gain a random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493719
    m_Localized: Your persistent digging pays off. A relic is buried farther beneath
      the pots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493720
    m_Localized: Signpost by the Sea
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493721
    m_Localized: "Strange, faded runes cover a crooked signpost. Are those\u2026
      bloodstains too? It points in several directions. One path is marked by a jumble
      of footprints."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493722
    m_Localized: Follow the Untrodden Path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493723
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493724
    m_Localized: You follow the untrodden path. It is far too quiet. After what feels
      like an age, you finally leave the coast, and the sound of people fills the
      road once more. It is as though you have just returned from another world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493725
    m_Localized: Follow the Footprints
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493726
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493727
    m_Localized: "Quiet. Far too quiet.\nSilence closes around you.\nIt is as though\u2026
      something is watching."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493728
    m_Localized: Tear Down the Sign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493729
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493730
    m_Localized: 'You tear down the wooden sign. No spooky nonsense is going to stand
      in your way.

      As it comes free, you think you hear the sea screaming.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493731
    m_Localized: Treasure Chest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493732
    m_Localized: "As the saying goes, \u201CThe best treasure chest is the one you
      haven't opened yet.\u201D\nWhen you find one by the roadside, you approach
      it with\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493733
    m_Localized: Excitement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493734
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493735
    m_Localized: "\u201CTo you who face the world with hope and optimism. May your
      life be full of promise and success.\u201D\nSo reads a little note inside the
      box.\nA gleaming silver coin rests beside it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493736
    m_Localized: Curiosity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493737
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493738
    m_Localized: "\u201CTo you who seek knowledge and greet the world with curiosity.
      May life live up to your hopes. At the end of your journey, may you have become
      someone you are happy to be.\u201D\nSo reads a little note inside the box.\nA
      gleaming silver coin rests beside it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493739
    m_Localized: Unease
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493740
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493741
    m_Localized: "\u201CThere is no need to panic or rush. There is still beauty
      in the world. If you fear the road ahead, or wonder whether you can turn back,
      lift your head and look around. The world is vast. Somewhere in it, peace awaits
      you.\u201D\nSo reads a little note inside the box.\nA gleaming silver coin
      rests beside it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493742
    m_Localized: Broken Bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493743
    m_Localized: An old rope bridge spans the gorge. A third of its boards are missing.
      Wind whistles through the gaps, making the remaining planks creak. It looks
      dangerously unstable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493744
    m_Localized: Cross Quickly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493745
    m_Localized: The party loses 10% HP. Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493746
    m_Localized: You step cautiously onto the bridge. Its boards creak in protest,
      the sound echoing through the gorge. Just before you reach the far side, a
      plank splits beneath your feet. You catch the ropes at the last possible moment.
      Everyone makes it across, though the rough ropes leave your hands covered in
      cuts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493747
    m_Localized: Take the Long Way Around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493748
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and heal the party by 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493749
    m_Localized: The detour takes much longer, but solid ground beneath your feet
      puts everyone at ease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493750
    m_Localized: Repair the Bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493751
    m_Localized: "Lose 2 AP and gain 25\u201335 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493752
    m_Localized: 'You decide to repair the crumbling bridge.

      After some hard
      work, a sturdy new bridge spans the gorge. You nod in satisfaction.

      A
      passing caravan stops to admire your work. Its merchants explain that they
      travel this route often, but their valuable cargo has always forced them to
      take a long detour around the unsafe bridge. Grateful for the repairs, they
      insist on giving you money and supplies, then wish you a safe journey.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493753
    m_Localized: The Whispering Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493754
    m_Localized: 'You arrive in a mountain village that will soon be submerged by
      a reservoir. The villagers are carrying away the last wooden crates, but a
      young woman still stands outside the ancestral hall.


      The village chief
      introduces her as Lin Zhi, the daughter of Lin Huai. She plans to visit the
      Whispering Well tonight, hoping to investigate a legend mentioned repeatedly
      among her father''s belongings before the well is sealed.


      Echoes have
      been wandering near the well of late. The chief asks you to accompany her.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493755
    m_Localized: Agree to Go Along
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493756
    m_Localized: Lose 5 AP and enter the Whispering Well dungeon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493757
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi approaches with a sound-sealed wooden case.\n\n\u201CThank
      you for coming. I'm an echo restorer. I only want to record the well and find
      out whether the legend is true. If anything comes near us, please buy me a
      little time.\u201D\n\nShe opens the case. Inside lie a pale echo conch, three
      tuning needles, a piece of sealing wax, and several blank shell fragments etched
      with tiny grooves for sound."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493758
    m_Localized: None of My Business
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493759
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493760
    m_Localized: Other people's problems are theirs to solve. You'll look after your
      own affairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493761
    m_Localized: Memories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493762
    m_Localized: A Request at the Village Gate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493763
    m_Localized: "As you arrive at the mountain village, the last crates are being
      carried through the gates. The reservoir will be opened tomorrow, and the village
      will close tonight.\n\nThe chief stops you and points to a young woman outside
      the ancestral hall.\n\n\u201CThat's Lin Zhi, Lin Huai's daughter. She's going
      to the Whispering Well tonight. Echoes have been wandering around it lately.
      Could you go with her?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493764
    m_Localized: Agree to Go Along
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493765
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493766
    m_Localized: "Hearing the chief, Lin Zhi approaches with a sound-sealed wooden
      case.\n\n\u201CThank you for coming. I'm an echo restorer. I only want to record
      the well and find out whether the legend is true. If anything comes near us,
      please buy me a little time.\u201D\n\nShe opens the case. Inside lie a pale
      echo conch, three tuning needles, a piece of sealing wax, and several blank
      shell fragments etched with tiny grooves for sound."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493767
    m_Localized: Lin Zhi's Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493768
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi takes out a blank shell fragment and shows you its grooves.\n\n\u201CAn
      echo conch can capture a person's voice. These shells preserve its pattern.
      If there really is a voice in the Whispering Well, we should be able to record
      it.\u201D\n\nHer father, Lin Huai, died recently. Among his belongings was
      a notebook filled with references to the well.\n\n\u201CHe never told me why
      my mother disappeared. They'll seal the well tonight. I can't wait any longer.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493769
    m_Localized: Fetch the Notebook from the Ancestral Hall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493770
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493771
    m_Localized: 'The ancestral hall is unlocked. Lin Huai''s old wooden chest stands
      beside the offering table, its lid still marked by freshly wiped water stains.


      Lin
      Zhi crouches down, opens it, and takes out a damp notebook.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493772
    m_Localized: Father's Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493773
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi spreads the notebook on the offering table. The first pages
      record water levels, rainfall, and cracks around the well. The later entries
      grow shorter and shorter.\n\nOn many pages, there is only one sentence.\n\n\u201CDon't
      let her listen to the well.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493774
    m_Localized: Keep Reading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493775
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493776
    m_Localized: "In the last few pages, you find Xu Yin's name written over and
      over. Lines have been drawn beside each entry. Some bear notes such as \u201CI
      remembered today\u201D and \u201CDon't forget.\u201D\n\nLin Zhi studies the
      words. \u201CXu Yin was my mother. People here say she followed the voice in
      the well eighteen years ago. But my father never let me ask about it.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493777
    m_Localized: Legend of the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493778
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi closes the notebook and explains the legend.\n\nAt midnight,
      anyone who leans close to the well can hear the last words of someone who has
      died. Each time they listen, they lose a memory of that person.\n\nShe fastens
      the sound-sealed case.\n\n\u201CThat's why I brought the echo conch. If we
      can capture the voice inside it, no one will have to pay with a memory.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493779
    m_Localized: Go to the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493780
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493781
    m_Localized: By the time you leave the ancestral hall, half the lights at the
      village gates have gone out. The path to the old well crosses abandoned vegetable
      plots. The ground is wet, and something has left drag marks in the grass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493782
    m_Localized: Shen Shuang, Keeper of the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493783
    m_Localized: "A white-haired woman sits beside the well. Lin Zhi calls her Granny
      Shen.\n\nShen Shuang nods to you as you approach with the sound-sealed case,
      then turns to Lin Zhi.\n\n\u201CI can't stop you. But you must understand.
      The Whispering Well leaves no voice in a conch or a shell. It lets only the
      living hear.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493784
    m_Localized: Help Lin Zhi Set Up the Recording Array
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493785
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493786
    m_Localized: "You place the three tuning needles around the rim of the well.
      Lin Zhi sets the echo conch in their center and seals its opening with wax.\n\nA
      faint ring of light appears on the shell.\n\n\u201CIf you hear someone's voice,\u201D
      Shen Shuang says, \u201Cyou'll forget something about them. Not everything
      at once. Just a piece.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493787
    m_Localized: Shen Shuang's Warning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493788
    m_Localized: "\u201CDid my father listen too?\u201D Lin Zhi asks.\n\nShen Shuang
      does not answer immediately. Her eyes rest on the rusty iron bell at the well's
      rim.\n\n\u201CMany times. So many that, in the end, I wasn't sure whether he
      still remembered why he came.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493789
    m_Localized: Wait Until Midnight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493790
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493791
    m_Localized: 'Before midnight, Lin Zhi checks the tuning needles once more and
      asks you to make sure the sealing wax has not cracked.


      There is no
      sound of water below. Only wind rising through the well wall.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493792
    m_Localized: The First Voice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493793
    m_Localized: "Midnight passes, but the echo conch remains dark.\n\nLin Zhi reaches
      to adjust the tuning needles, then freezes. She looks at you, then at the mouth
      of the well.\n\nA woman's voice rises from below.\n\n\u201CZhizhi, don't blame
      your father.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493794
    m_Localized: Examine the Echo Conch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493795
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493796
    m_Localized: 'You lift the echo conch. Its shell is cold. Inside, there is only
      the sound of wind.


      No sound pattern has appeared on the blank shells.


      Lin
      Zhi says it was her mother, Xu Yin. She does not ask you to believe her. She
      simply writes the words in the notebook''s margin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493797
    m_Localized: A Voice That Won't Stay Sealed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493798
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi tries again. She asks you to stand farther back and moves
      the echo conch closer to the well.\n\nThe voice does not return. The shells
      remain blank.\n\n\u201CThe well has taken its first payment,\u201D Shen Shuang
      says."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493799
    m_Localized: Ask What the Well Took
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493800
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493801
    m_Localized: "At first, Lin Zhi says nothing has changed. But as you pass the
      village kitchen, she stops in the doorway.\n\nShe remembers her mother cooking
      a dish here. She remembers sitting on the threshold, waiting. Yet she cannot
      recall what the dish was called, or how it tasted.\n\nShe rests a hand on the
      stove. \u201CThe legend is true.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493802
    m_Localized: The Second Whisper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493803
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi does not leave. She asks you to stay with her while she
      listens once more.\n\n\u201CIf my mother really left a message, I need to know
      why she disappeared.\u201D\n\nShe approaches the rim. You steady the recording
      array so the wind will not topple the tuning needles."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493804
    m_Localized: Stand Watch by the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493805
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493806
    m_Localized: "A second sentence rises from the well.\n\n\u201CI didn't leave
      of my own accord that night.\u201D\n\nLin Zhi writes it down. Then she suddenly
      asks, \u201CDid I tell you earlier that my mother had a beautiful smile?\u201D\n\nShe
      remembers saying so. But she can no longer picture that smile."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493807
    m_Localized: The Third Whisper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493808
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi wants to keep listening. Shen Shuang catches her wrist.\n\n\u201CThe
      longer you listen, the less will remain of the person you're looking for.\u201D\n\nLin
      Zhi does not pull away. She only asks, \u201CThen why did my father keep coming
      back?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493809
    m_Localized: Wait for Shen Shuang's Answer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493810
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493811
    m_Localized: "Shen Shuang glances at you, as if making sure someone can still
      bring Lin Zhi home.\n\n\u201CBecause eighteen years ago, Lin Huai was the one
      who heard the last words.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493812
    m_Localized: The Night of the Flood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493813
    m_Localized: 'After the battle, the iron bell is still swaying.


      Shen
      Shuang tells you that the flash flood came without warning eighteen years ago.
      Xu Yin was the first to hear the mountainside cracking. She ran to the well
      and rang the bell, waking the village.


      The villagers escaped. Xu Yin
      was trapped beneath the well by the landslide.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493814
    m_Localized: Let Shen Shuang Finish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493815
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493816
    m_Localized: "By the time Lin Huai arrived, the well wall had collapsed. Rainwater
      and mud poured into the shaft. All he could do was lean over the rim and call
      Xu Yin's name.\n\nHer final words were these.\n\n\u201CDon't let Zhizhi remember
      how much it hurt to die.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493817
    m_Localized: Why Lin Huai Stayed Silent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493818
    m_Localized: 'Shen Shuang says the Whispering Well preserved Xu Yin''s last words,
      and made them a duty Lin Huai would carry for the rest of his life.


      He
      returned again and again, trading his memories for the voice Xu Yin had left
      behind.

      He wanted to know whether their daughter was growing up well,
      what he should tell her, and which sorrows she should be spared until she was
      older.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493819
    m_Localized: Read Lin Huai's Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493820
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493821
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi opens her father's notebook.\n\nBeside the names he wrote
      again and again, you notice smaller lines of text.\n\n\u201CToday I forgot
      the tune she used to sing.\u201D\n\u201CToday I couldn't remember how she looked
      in her wedding dress.\u201D\n\u201CToday I still remember her name was Xu Yin.\u201D\n\u201CDon't
      let Zhizhi listen to the well.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493822
    m_Localized: What Father Left Blank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493823
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi stares at the page for a long time. She no longer asks
      why her father stayed silent.\n\nAt last, she understands. Lin Huai had not
      refused to speak of Xu Yin. He had traded every answer he could for his daughter,
      and left everything he could bear to forget beside the well.\n\n\u201CIn the
      end, he wasn't even sure of Xu Yin's voice,\u201D Shen Shuang says. \u201CBut
      he still remembered that he mustn't let you listen.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493824
    m_Localized: Return to the Well with Lin Zhi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493825
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493826
    m_Localized: The last night before the well is sealed has arrived. The construction
      crew will close its mouth in the morning. Once the reservoir is opened, this
      place will vanish beneath the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493827
    m_Localized: The Last Night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493828
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi stands beside the well. This time, she does not set up
      the recording array.\n\n\u201CIf I listen again, I may lose more memories of
      my mother,\u201D she says. \u201CBut if my father left something to say\u2026
      shouldn't I hear it?\u201D\n\nShen Shuang leaves the choice to her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493829
    m_Localized: Stay with Her by the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493830
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493831
    m_Localized: "The voice rising from the well belongs to neither Xu Yin nor a
      stranger.\n\nIt is Lin Huai.\n\n\u201CZhizhi, I wasn't a very good father.
      But I tried so hard to carry that pain for you.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493832
    m_Localized: Asking for No More Voices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493833
    m_Localized: "Lin Zhi crouches beside the well, silent for a long while.\n\nThen
      she lowers her father's notebook, her mother's hairpin, and the echo conch
      that could never hold the well's voice into the darkness.\n\n\u201CYou don't
      have to say any more,\u201D she whispers. \u201CI heard you.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493834
    m_Localized: Leave the Well
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493835
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493836
    m_Localized: "The next day, the reservoir is opened. Water slowly rises over
      the Whispering Well.\n\nYou hear someone ask Lin Zhi what her father was like.
      She thinks for a long time before answering.\n\n\u201CHe was a man with a very
      quiet voice.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493837
    m_Localized: Wrecked Carriage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493838
    m_Localized: "A broken carriage is sunk in the mud, its door half-open. Water-swollen
      crates fill the interior. Strangely, it seems much larger inside than it does
      outside\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493839
    m_Localized: Search the Luggage Rack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493840
    m_Localized: "Gain 10\u201318 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493841
    m_Localized: You find some gold on the luggage rack. Who would abandon both their
      luggage and their money in a carriage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493842
    m_Localized: Pry Open the Locked Crate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493843
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP and gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493844
    m_Localized: With considerable effort, you pry open a crate that looks less waterlogged
      than the others. Hopefully, its contents will be useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493845
    m_Localized: Venture Deeper Inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493846
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493847
    m_Localized: 'The space inside has clearly been distorted. Something is very
      wrong here.

      You decide to investigate farther in.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493848
    m_Localized: Rusted Altar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493849
    m_Localized: A rust-covered altar blocks the road. A recess in its center looks
      as though it could hold some kind of material.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493850
    m_Localized: Offer a Piece of Loot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493851
    m_Localized: Lose 1 random loot item and gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493852
    m_Localized: The altar seems to sense your offering and gives off a faint purple
      glow. In the blink of an eye, the loot you placed upon it becomes a relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493853
    m_Localized: Smash the Altar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493854
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP and gain 2 random loot items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493855
    m_Localized: 'You smash the altar. Nothing about it looks auspicious.

      Beneath
      the platform where offerings once stood, you discover things that other visitors
      seem to have left behind.

      You take them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493856
    m_Localized: Reflection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493857
    m_Localized: 'A shallow puddle lies in the road. In this sweltering weather,
      there should be no standing water. Curious, you stop to look.

      It seems
      entirely ordinary. Then, just as you turn away, you notice something deeply
      wrong.

      Your reflection is not moving.

      It is simply staring at
      you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493858
    m_Localized: Stamp on the Reflection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493859
    m_Localized: Enter a special battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493860
    m_Localized: 'You stamp on the reflection. Ripples obscure the water, and droplets
      scatter across the road.

      When the surface finally settles, you look
      again.

      There is no one in it.

      You lift your head. Somehow, your
      reflection is now standing in front of you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493861
    m_Localized: Drink Some Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493862
    m_Localized: Are you sure you want to do this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493863
    m_Localized: 'You take a sip of the puddle''s water. It is strangely sweet and
      refreshing.

      When you look again, the figure beneath the surface has
      vanished.

      Never mind. All you want is another sip.

      You feel full
      of energy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493864
    m_Localized: Walk Around the Puddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493865
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493866
    m_Localized: "Whatever lurks in there, surely it won't come after you if you
      leave it alone\u2026 right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493867
    m_Localized: Mystery Box Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493868
    m_Localized: "An unmarked stall stands by the roadside. Its owner has packed
      all the merchandise into boxes. Mystery boxes, apparently.\n\u201CStep right
      up! Care for a mystery box? Fantastic value! No returns or exchanges!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493869
    m_Localized: Choose the Smallest Parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493870
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493871
    m_Localized: "The merchant gives you a sly smile and hands over a little parcel.
      You open it to find gold inside.\n\u201CWow! Gold! Between you and me, even
      I don't know exactly how much is in there!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493872
    m_Localized: Choose the Heaviest Parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493873
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493874
    m_Localized: "\u201CA fine choice, friend! Though even I don't know what's inside!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493875
    m_Localized: Choose the Largest Parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493876
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493877
    m_Localized: "\u201CGo on! Open it! What's inside?\u201D\nYou unwrap the parcel
      and find\u2026 another parcel.\nYou have obtained a parcel in a parcel.\nA
      nested parcel?\nA parcel parcel?\nA parcel containing a parcel containing a
      parcel?\nWhile you puzzle over the wording, the merchant makes his escape."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493878
    m_Localized: Leave Without Buying
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493879
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493880
    m_Localized: "\u201CTsk.\u201D\nThe merchant clicks his tongue. Is he going to
      attack you? In broad daylight? Force you to buy something?\nYou watch him warily.
      He only swatted a mosquito.\n\u201CWhat a shame! Until next time, friend!\u201D\nToo
      bad. If he had forced the sale, you could have filed a complaint for ten times
      the price."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493881
    m_Localized: Unclaimed Letter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493882
    m_Localized: "A blood-red letter is wedged into a signpost, its wax seal intact.
      There is no signature on the envelope. Only a warning.\n\u201CPlease do not
      open.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493883
    m_Localized: Open the Letter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493884
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493885
    m_Localized: 'You open the letter. It is covered in crooked, unfamiliar symbols
      that writhe as if alive.

      Slowly, they turn a glaring scarlet. A wave
      of nausea overwhelms you, and the letter slips from your fingers.

      The
      moment you let go of the paper, the sickness vanishes.

      You decide to
      leave it on the ground.

      Still, you have the unsettling sense that some
      forbidden knowledge has found its way into your mind.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493886
    m_Localized: Ignore the Letter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493887
    m_Localized: Recover 1 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493888
    m_Localized: If it says not to open it, you won't. Why invite trouble?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493889
    m_Localized: Burn the Letter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493890
    m_Localized: The party gains 5 XP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493891
    m_Localized: 'You decide to burn the letter. Something so strange must be the
      work of dark magic or an evil power.

      Destroying it might spare the next
      person who would have read it.

      As the unknown message turns to ash,
      you feel your soul lifted in some small way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781572493892
    m_Localized: Leaning Bell Tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687616
    m_Localized: 'A small bell tower leans against the hillside.

      Its bell
      sways gently without a breeze. Every chime makes you feel as though a little
      time has slipped away.

      It will soon be time to ring the bell, but no
      one seems to be tending the tower.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687617
    m_Localized: Ring the Bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687618
    m_Localized: Fully restore AP and enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687619
    m_Localized: "You ring the great bell.\nDong\u2026 dong\u2026\nFor a moment,
      its voice seems to fill the whole world.\nUnfortunately, it also attracts several
      hostile creatures."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687620
    m_Localized: Pick Up the Pace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687621
    m_Localized: Recover 4 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687622
    m_Localized: 'The passing of time makes you restless.

      You urge the party
      to pick up the pace and press on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687623
    m_Localized: Take a Short Rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687624
    m_Localized: Heal the party by 20% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687625
    m_Localized: Why rush? Better take the time to recover your strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687626
    m_Localized: Extinguished Campfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687627
    m_Localized: 'A recently extinguished campfire lies by the road, still trailing
      wisps of smoke.

      Someone must have left this makeshift camp only moments
      ago. A few things remain nearby, though you cannot tell whether they were forgotten
      or abandoned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687628
    m_Localized: Take a Short Rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687629
    m_Localized: Recover 3 AP and heal the party by 10% HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687630
    m_Localized: 'You relight the campfire and rest, keeping an eye out in case the
      camp''s owner returns for their belongings.

      After a full night''s rest,
      no one has come back.

      You set off again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687631
    m_Localized: Take Some Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687632
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687633
    m_Localized: 'The owner probably isn''t coming back. That makes these things
      abandoned.

      You are happy to give them a new home.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687634
    m_Localized: Tangled Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687635
    m_Localized: A battered wooden puppet hangs from a branch, a cord tight around
      its neck. It looks as though it has been hanged. Threads trail from its body
      into the depths of the forest. Its head hangs low, as if waiting for someone
      to untie it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687636
    m_Localized: Untie the Puppet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687637
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random uncommon loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687638
    m_Localized: 'You climb the tree and struggle to loosen the cord around the puppet''s
      neck.

      The instant it comes free, the puppet wriggles from your hands
      as though alive, jumps to the ground, and shatters.

      Perhaps too much
      freedom can be a dangerous thing.

      With a sigh, you pick a gleaming object
      out of its broken remains.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687639
    m_Localized: Follow the Threads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687640
    m_Localized: Enter an extremely difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687641
    m_Localized: "You decide to find whoever is pulling the strings.\nThe deeper
      you venture into the woods, the more threads you see. Soon they cover everything.
      Like a spider's web, they must lead to a master at the center.\n\u201CAnother
      catch.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687642
    m_Localized: Medical Kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687643
    m_Localized: "A white medical kit rests on a stone, its lid slightly open. The
      bandages inside look far too neat to have been used.\nA sign reads, \u201C30
      gold per treatment. No credit.\u201D\nThere is no sign of a doctor. In fact,
      there is no one here at all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687644
    m_Localized: Receive Treatment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687645
    m_Localized: Heal the party by 50% of max HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687646
    m_Localized: 'Once you pay, the bandages and medical instruments float up and
      begin treating the party on their own.

      Before long, your wounds are
      almost completely healed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687647
    m_Localized: Take the Gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687648
    m_Localized: The party loses 30% HP. Gain 50 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687649
    m_Localized: "You decide to pocket the money left by previous customers. No one
      is watching, after all.\nAs you scoop up the gold, a scalpel floats slowly
      out of the medical kit, then plunges straight into your backside.\n\u201CYEOOOW!\u201D\nYou
      flee for your life. At least you got the money."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687650
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687651
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687652
    m_Localized: You don't need treatment. Better keep moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687653
    m_Localized: Light Between the Stones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687654
    m_Localized: 'You squeeze through a narrow cleft in the rocks.

      A tiny
      light shines from a crack in the wall, as though someone has lit a lamp inside
      the stone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687655
    m_Localized: Break Through the Rock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687656
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP and gain 1 random blueprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687657
    m_Localized: 'You chip through the rock face and uncover what seems to have been
      a library.

      Dust blankets the floor and tables, but you quickly spot
      a valuable scroll on one of the desks.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687658
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687659
    m_Localized: Recover 1 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687660
    m_Localized: Curiosity killed the cat. You have a journey to finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687661
    m_Localized: Investigate with a Torch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687662
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687663
    m_Localized: 'You light a torch and push it through the crack. A stray spark
      catches, and flames roar through the space beyond, burning everything in moments.

      When
      the fire dies down, you notice something that still looks valuable within arm''s
      reach.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687664
    m_Localized: Old Gambling Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687665
    m_Localized: A gambling table stands in the middle of a clearing. Three cups
      sit upside down upon it. There is no dealer, but the cups begin to move by
      themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687666
    m_Localized: Make a Small Bet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687667
    m_Localized: "Gain 0\u201320 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687668
    m_Localized: 'A little gambling is fun. Too much empties your purse.

      You''ll
      make a small bet. If you lose, you can laugh it off.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687669
    m_Localized: Make a Big Bet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687670
    m_Localized: "Gain 0\u201366 gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687671
    m_Localized: This is what you earned that money for! May fortune smile on you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687672
    m_Localized: Stay Away from the Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687673
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687674
    m_Localized: 'You resist the temptation.

      The odds favor the house. Walking
      away is its own win.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687675
    m_Localized: Old Gambling Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687676
    m_Localized: "You lift a cup and count the money.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687677
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687678
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687679
    m_Localized: That will do nicely. Time to get back on the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687680
    m_Localized: Overturn the Gambling Table
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687681
    m_Localized: Gain 66 gold and enter a special battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687682
    m_Localized: 'To hell with this! They must be cheating!

      Furious at how
      little gold you won, you sweep every coin off the table and overturn it.

      But
      the space beneath is not empty.

      A pair of eyes stares back at you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687683
    m_Localized: The Recurring Door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687684
    m_Localized: This is the third time you have seen this door. It has no walls
      and no room beyond it. It simply stands alone in the middle of the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687685
    m_Localized: Open the Door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687686
    m_Localized: Enter a special dungeon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687687
    m_Localized: 'You push the door open. Beyond it lies a long, narrow passage.

      An
      identical door waits at the far end.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687688
    m_Localized: Walk Around the Door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687689
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687690
    m_Localized: 'Once again, you walk around the door.

      Perhaps it finally
      gives up. You never see it again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687691
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687692
    m_Localized: "A roadside gambler calls out, \u201CCare to try your luck?\u201D\nHe
      sets three battered bowls upside down in a row.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687693
    m_Localized: I'll Try My Luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687694
    m_Localized: Choose one of three bowls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687695
    m_Localized: "The gambler laughs. \u201CWin everything, or walk away with nothing!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687696
    m_Localized: No, Thanks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687697
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687698
    m_Localized: "You turn away. Disappointed, the gambler swears after you. \u201CCoward!
      You would've lost anyway!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687699
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687700
    m_Localized: You remember the gambler. Surprisingly, he hadn't tricked you after
      all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687701
    m_Localized: Continue Onward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687702
    m_Localized: Three Trash Bags automatically combine into a Golden Trash Bag with
      a much larger bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687703
    m_Localized: You remember the gambler. Surprisingly, he hadn't tricked you after
      all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687704
    m_Localized: The Gambler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687705
    m_Localized: "The gambler pushes three battered bowls toward you.\n\n\u201CChoose.
      No regrets.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687706
    m_Localized: Choose the Left Bowl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687707
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687708
    m_Localized: 'Gain the Trash Bag relic.

      Your subsequent equipment fusions
      have a 50% chance to create a Trash Bag.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687709
    m_Localized: "The gambler laughs. \u201CI didn't think anyone had worse luck
      than me! Thanks for the 30 gold!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687710
    m_Localized: "Lose all gold, then regain 50\u2013150% of your original amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687711
    m_Localized: "The gambler sneers. \u201CHow's your luck treating you?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687712
    m_Localized: Reforge 3 random relics in your inventory into relics of the same
      rarity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687713
    m_Localized: "The gambler rubs his nose. \u201CDidn't come out ahead that time,
      did I?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687714
    m_Localized: Choose the Middle Bowl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687715
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687716
    m_Localized: 'Gain the Trash Bag relic.

      Your subsequent equipment fusions
      have a 50% chance to create a Trash Bag.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687717
    m_Localized: "The gambler laughs. \u201CI didn't think anyone had worse luck
      than me! Thanks for the 30 gold!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687718
    m_Localized: "Lose all gold, then regain 50\u2013150% of your original amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687719
    m_Localized: "The gambler sneers. \u201CHow's your luck treating you?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687720
    m_Localized: Reforge 3 random relics in your inventory into relics of the same
      rarity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687721
    m_Localized: "The gambler rubs his nose. \u201CDidn't come out ahead that time,
      did I?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687722
    m_Localized: Choose the Right Bowl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687723
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687724
    m_Localized: 'Gain the Trash Bag relic.

      Your subsequent equipment fusions
      have a 50% chance to create a Trash Bag.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687725
    m_Localized: "The gambler laughs. \u201CI didn't think anyone had worse luck
      than me! Thanks for the 30 gold!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687726
    m_Localized: "Lose all gold, then regain 50\u2013150% of your original amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687727
    m_Localized: "The gambler sneers. \u201CHow's your luck treating you?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687728
    m_Localized: Reforge 3 random relics in your inventory into relics of the same
      rarity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687729
    m_Localized: "The gambler rubs his nose. \u201CDidn't come out ahead that time,
      did I?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687730
    m_Localized: Investment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687731
    m_Localized: "You pass an investment firm that looks thoroughly professional.
      A notice outside reads, \u201CHigh risk, high returns! Instant riches could
      be yours!\u201D\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687732
    m_Localized: Make a Small Investment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687733
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687734
    m_Localized: "Not a bad return! The company manager greets you in person and
      recommends an even better investment service.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687735
    m_Localized: Pass. I'm Not Feeling Lucky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687736
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687737
    m_Localized: You decide against investing and continue on your way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687738
    m_Localized: Investment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687739
    m_Localized: "Beaming, the manager hands you a contract full of unreadable fine
      print.\n\n\u201CNow this is a truly premium investment.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687740
    m_Localized: Invest Half Your Gold Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687741
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687742
    m_Localized: Earn a profit equal to 100% of your original gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687743
    m_Localized: "The manager thumps his chest. \u201CRest assured, our company is
      completely trustworthy! Care to invest a little more?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687744
    m_Localized: Lose your investment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687745
    m_Localized: You receive nothing. Better stop investing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687746
    m_Localized: Quit While You're Ahead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687747
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687748
    m_Localized: You quit while you're ahead and continue on your way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687749
    m_Localized: Investment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687750
    m_Localized: "The manager lowers his voice and slides one last contract toward
      you.\n\n\u201CGoing all in. Now that's wisdom.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687751
    m_Localized: Go All In. That's Wisdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687752
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687753
    m_Localized: Earn a profit equal to 300% of your original gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687754
    m_Localized: You make an absolute fortune.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687755
    m_Localized: Lose your investment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687756
    m_Localized: Empty-handed, you leave the investment firm in disappointment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687757
    m_Localized: Quit While You're Ahead
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687758
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687759
    m_Localized: You quit while you're ahead and continue on your way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687760
    m_Localized: Wei Yu Mu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687761
    m_Localized: "You meet the game's dear designer. Seeing how hard you've struggled,
      he wants to restore your faith in the adventure.\n\u201CWhat would you like?\u201D
      he asks.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687762
    m_Localized: I Want Legendary Relics!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687763
    m_Localized: Gain three legendary relics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687764
    m_Localized: "The designer smiles warmly. \u201CNo problem! Coming right up!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687765
    m_Localized: I Want Lots of Gold!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687766
    m_Localized: Gain 1,000 gold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687767
    m_Localized: "The designer waves a generous hand. \u201CAll yours!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687768
    m_Localized: I Want Legendary Weapons!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687769
    m_Localized: Gain three legendary weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687770
    m_Localized: "Golden light blazes in the designer's hands. \u201CLegendary!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687771
    m_Localized: I Want Trash Bags!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687772
    m_Localized: Gain three Golden Trash Bags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687773
    m_Localized: "The designer scratches his head. \u201CWho asks for trash bags?
      Well, all right. Three Golden Trash Bags, coming up.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687774
    m_Localized: A Noble's Inheritance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687775
    m_Localized: "You stand before a dilapidated castle. A rotting wooden sign hangs
      beside its crooked gate.\n\u201CAwaiting the one chosen by fate\u2026\u201D\nYou
      decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687776
    m_Localized: Take a Look Inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687777
    m_Localized: Lose 1 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687778
    m_Localized: "Inside the castle, you find a note on a wooden table. Its upper
      half has rotted away. What remains reads, \u201CWill you inherit everything
      he possessed?\u201D\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687779
    m_Localized: Pass. Who Knows What Awaits?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687780
    m_Localized: Nothing happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687781
    m_Localized: You turn away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687782
    m_Localized: A Noble's Inheritance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687783
    m_Localized: "Inside the castle, you find a note on a wooden table. Its upper
      half has rotted away. What remains reads, \u201CWill you inherit everything
      he possessed?\u201D\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687784
    m_Localized: I'll Accept the Inheritance!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687785
    m_Localized: Lose 1 extra AP and enter a difficult battle. Win to receive a relic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687786
    m_Localized: "Several dark figures rush out. \u201CAt last! Someone's here to
      pay the debts! We've been waiting forever!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687787
    m_Localized: Leave What Isn't Yours Alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687788
    m_Localized: Enter a difficult battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687789
    m_Localized: "Several dark figures rush out. \u201CThink you can get away by
      refusing? We finally get a living visitor after hundreds of years! You're paying
      his debts!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687790
    m_Localized: The Heir's Legacy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687791
    m_Localized: "You pass a ruined castle. Something has smashed through its heavy
      wooden gate. A rotting sign stands in the earth outside. Wind and rain have
      worn away most of its writing, leaving only a few legible words.\n\n\u201CInherit
      all that is mine\u2026\u201D\n\nSomething deep within the castle draws you
      closer, as though someone has waited through the ages for an answer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687792
    m_Localized: This Feels Like Fate. Let's Look Inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687793
    m_Localized: Lose 5 AP and enter The Heir's Revenge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687794
    m_Localized: "You step through the broken gate into the damp, bitter cold. A
      crooked wooden table stands alone in the hall. Half a decaying note lies upon
      it.\n\n\u201CWill you inherit everything he possessed?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687795
    m_Localized: Better Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687796
    m_Localized: Recover 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687797
    m_Localized: 'The castle''s dark interior chills you. You turn to leave.


      At
      that instant, a cold draft brushes your back, as though something is watching
      you. You glance over your shoulder. The doorway is empty.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687798
    m_Localized: The Steward's Request
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687799
    m_Localized: "You cross the castle threshold, and your vision blurs.\n\nAn old
      man in black stands in the center of the hall. His face is withered, his eyes
      downcast. His voice seems to seep from cracks in the walls. \u201CYou covet
      my master's inheritance too?\u201D\n\nYou explain that the sign brought you
      here. He sneers. \u201CYou make no effort to hide your greed. Good. Fulfill
      my master's last wish, and everything he possessed will be yours.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687800
    m_Localized: I'm Willing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687801
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687802
    m_Localized: "The old man gives a slight nod. His weathered face betrays no expression.\n\n\u201CGood.
      Follow me.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687803
    m_Localized: The Heir's Last Wish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687804
    m_Localized: "You follow the old man deeper into the castle. Cold wind whistles
      through broken windows, circling the dark corridors like a distant wail.\n\nOther
      sounds mingle with it. Harsh commands, piercing screams, strange laughter,
      furious roars. They seem to be telling you something, but you cannot make out
      a single word.\n\nThe old man stops and turns. \u201CWhat did you hear?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687805
    m_Localized: I Heard Many Voices, but Couldn't Make Out the Words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687806
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687807
    m_Localized: "You tell him the truth. He nods silently and leads you to a stone
      door.\n\nA deep sword mark cuts across it. Large brown stains cling to the
      stone beside it, like dried blood.\n\n\u201CMy master's secret chamber. Everything
      he possessed is inside. His diary lies on the desk. Read it and fulfill his
      last wish, and I will reward you. Try nothing clever. I will be watching.\u201D\n\nYou
      push open the door and pick up the dust-covered diary. The moment you turn
      the first page, a tremendous force surges from the paper and pulls you inside."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687808
    m_Localized: The Heir's Past
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687809
    m_Localized: "You tumble onto a polished marble floor. Looking up, you find yourself
      in a magnificent palace.\n\nA crowned king smiles at two princes kneeling before
      him. The armored prince on the left presents the severed head of an enemy commander
      as proof of his victory.\n\nNo one can see you. The old man appears at your
      side and murmurs, \u201CThat is my master. The late king named him crown prince.
      In those days, the whole nation believed he would be their next king.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687810
    m_Localized: But He Never Became King, Did He?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687811
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687812
    m_Localized: "The old man nods grimly. The palace vanishes, replaced by a narrow
      gorge.\n\nThe young crown prince stands in bloodstained silver armor, his blade
      buried deep in the king's chest. The king is dead, his empty eyes fixed on
      the prince.\n\nThe old man's voice echoes through the gorge. \u201CWhen the
      invaders came, the late king led his army to the front. He was ambushed here
      and killed. Every surviving soldier accused my master of conspiring with the
      enemy and leading the rebels who murdered him.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687813
    m_Localized: A Prince's Betrayal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687814
    m_Localized: "Soldiers surround the crown prince, roaring for the traitor's death
      and vengeance for their king.\n\nAs you stare, the old man shoves you forward.
      Suddenly, you are standing beside the prince, and every furious gaze is turned
      on you.\n\nThe old man's voice fills the gorge. \u201CProtect my master. Get
      him back to the palace, or his inheritance will never be yours.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687815
    m_Localized: I'll Get the Crown Prince Back to the Palace!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687816
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687817
    m_Localized: 'You grip your longsword and stand between the crown prince and
      his pursuers.


      His loyal retainers rally around you. Together, you must
      cut a path through the soldiers and get him out of the gorge.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687818
    m_Localized: The Final Verdict
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687819
    m_Localized: "You fight your way out of the gorge with the crown prince's loyal
      retainers and escort the wounded prince to the palace.\n\nThe second prince
      is already waiting with his army.\n\n\u201CYou've returned, you patricidal
      beast.\u201D His gaze is ice-cold. \u201CFather was a fool to make a traitor
      his heir. Today I will cleanse our family in his name.\u201D\n\nBacked against
      a stone door, the crown prince trembles around the hilt of his broken sword.
      \u201CI'm no traitor. Don't believe their lies.\u201D\n\n\u201CEveryone saw
      what you did. Still you deny it?\u201D The second prince lunges, pinning his
      brother to the door. Blood splashes across the stone. The crown prince fixes
      him with a terrible stare. \u201CYou'll regret\u2014\u201D\n\nThe second prince
      wrenches his blade free and cuts off his brother's head.\n\nThe old man appears
      at your side. \u201CThis was my master's regret. Tell me. Did he betray his
      country?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687820
    m_Localized: He Betrayed His Country. He Deserved to Die!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687821
    m_Localized: Enter a desperate battle and end the event.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687822
    m_Localized: "You answer without hesitation. The old man falls silent, then throws
      back his head and laughs.\n\n\u201CI thought you might see the truth. But you're
      as blind as all the rest. So this is fate!\u201D\n\nHis form twists into the
      blood-soaked crown prince, armor gleaming crimson. He raises a bloody longsword
      and swings at you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687823
    m_Localized: Wait. Something Doesn't Add Up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687824
    m_Localized: Continue the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687825
    m_Localized: "The old man is silent for a moment. \u201CExplain.\u201D\n\nYou
      recall the soldiers in the gorge and outside the palace. \u201CEvery soldier
      who attacked the crown prince wore a green scarf. The soldiers who died beside
      the king did not. Those wearing green must have served the second prince.\u201D\n\nThe
      old man laughs. \u201CExactly! They were the rebels. They killed the late king
      before my master could reach him, then laid the blame at his feet.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687826
    m_Localized: The True Last Wish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687827
    m_Localized: "A little light returns to the old man's clouded eyes.\n\n\u201CKeep
      watching.\u201D\n\nHe raises his withered hand, and the scene changes again.
      The second prince sits at a desk, the diary before him. A middle-aged nobleman
      kneels nearby, smiling obsequiously.\n\n\u201CThe whole country will despise
      the former crown prince. We've done it, Your Highness. Tomorrow, you take the
      throne. I trust you won't forget my service.\u201D\n\n\u201CNaturally.\u201D
      The second prince smiles. \u201CBut first, I need one final favor.\u201D\n\nThe
      nobleman nods eagerly. \u201CAnything, Your Highness.\u201D\n\nThe prince extends
      a hand. \u201CKeep our secret.\u201D\n\nA dark figure darts out behind the
      nobleman and cuts him down. The prince drops the diary and leaves the chamber.
      \u201COnly the dead can keep a secret. Seal this room. My brother's diary above
      all. If I cannot claim its power, no one shall.\u201D\n\nThe old man pats your
      shoulder. \u201CTell me. What was my master's last wish?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687828
    m_Localized: Avenge the Late King. Kill the Second Prince.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687829
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687830
    m_Localized: "The old man nods in satisfaction.\n\n\u201CGo. You'll find him
      before the palace. Kill him. Avenge my master and the late king.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687831
    m_Localized: Fulfill the Last Wish?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687832
    m_Localized: "Following the old man's instructions, you reach the second prince's
      palace.\n\nThe hall is empty except for the prince on his throne. He shows
      no surprise at your arrival. He merely sneers. \u201CMy brother's ghost. Do
      you really think you can kill me?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687833
    m_Localized: Only One Way to Find Out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687834
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687835
    m_Localized: 'You draw your longsword and point it at the second prince.


      Every
      candle before the throne goes out at once. Deep darkness swallows the palace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687836
    m_Localized: The One Behind It All
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687837
    m_Localized: "Your blade wounds the second prince. He collapses in a pool of
      blood, staring in terror at something behind you.\n\nYou whirl around. The
      old man stands there, the diary's cover peeling away in his hands. His face
      grows younger, revealing the middle-aged nobleman whom the prince had ordered
      killed.\n\n\u201CYour Highness, it seems I win after all.\u201D The nobleman
      sneers. \u201CYour greatest mistake was sealing my body away with your brother's
      diary. Its power kept me alive, and gave me the chance to rewrite history.\u201D\n\nHe
      turns to you. \u201CA little foolish, perhaps, but a useful blade. Unfortunately,
      I share His Highness's belief. Only the dead can keep a secret.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687838
    m_Localized: Only If You Can Kill Me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687839
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687840
    m_Localized: 'You turn your blade on the nobleman as fast as you can.


      A
      dull golden light spills from the diary in his hands. The palace walls begin
      to peel away, and past and present overlap. At last, the true schemer stands
      revealed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687841
    m_Localized: The Heir's Gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687842
    m_Localized: "During the battle, your hand brushes the diary. Golden light bursts
      from its pages. The nobleman's body rapidly withers, and you seize the opening
      to cut him down.\n\nYou pick up the diary and turn to its final page. There,
      at last, is the crown prince's true wish. Defeat the second prince and the
      nobleman who altered history, avenge him and the late king, and find a true
      hero to inherit the throne.\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687843
    m_Localized: I'll Fulfill Your Last Wish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687844
    m_Localized: End the event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687845
    m_Localized: 'The diary looks new again. The palace throne slowly slides aside,
      revealing stairs to a treasury.


      You receive the kingdom''s final gift.
      After you leave, the old castle collapses, as though the wronged spirits and
      lies that burdened it for so many years have finally been laid to rest.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687846
    m_Localized: Game of Luck, Part One
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687847
    m_Localized: "A witch approaches, brandishing a crystal ball. \u201CYoung traveler,
      you have a remarkable aura. You and treasure were destined to meet!\u201D\n\nShe
      seizes your hand and presses it against the crystal. \u201CCome now, repeat
      the spell after me. Treasure is guaranteed!\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687848
    m_Localized: What Is This Nonsense?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687849
    m_Localized: Lose 2 extra AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687850
    m_Localized: You angrily wrench your hand free and turn to leave. The witch's
      sharp nails rake your skin, costing you 2 AP. You gain nothing. A loss all
      around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687851
    m_Localized: All Right. I'll Try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687852
    m_Localized: Gain 1 random loot item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687853
    m_Localized: Gritting your teeth, you agree and repeat the spell after her. Smiling,
      the witch tosses you a piece of loot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687854
    m_Localized: Game of Luck, Part Two
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687855
    m_Localized: "A witch approaches, brandishing a crystal ball. \u201CHello again,
      young traveler! Your forehead looks pale today. That must mean you're about
      to win the grand prize!\u201D\n\nShe seizes your hand and presses it against
      the crystal. \u201CCome now, repeat the spell after me.\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687856
    m_Localized: What Is This Nonsense?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687857
    m_Localized: Lose 2 AP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687858
    m_Localized: You angrily wrench your hand free and turn to leave. The witch's
      sharp nails rake your skin, costing you 2 AP. You gain nothing. A loss all
      around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687859
    m_Localized: All Right. I'll Try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687860
    m_Localized: Enter the Labyrinth of Luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687861
    m_Localized: Gritting your teeth, you agree and repeat the spell after her. Suddenly,
      the ground drops away, and you fall into a maze.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687862
    m_Localized: Washroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687863
    m_Localized: "Your starting point is a toilet. You nearly fall into the bowl.
      After putting your bottom's eight shattered pieces back together, you look
      at the two doors.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687864
    m_Localized: Try the Left Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687865
    m_Localized: Enter Driving Test 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687866
    m_Localized: "You enter the room on the left. Its sign reads \u201CDriving Test
      1.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687867
    m_Localized: Try the Right Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687868
    m_Localized: Enter Square Root 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687869
    m_Localized: "You enter the room on the right. Its sign reads \u201CSquare Root
      of 1.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687870
    m_Localized: Spend Another Day in the Toilet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687871
    m_Localized: Restore every party member to full HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687872
    m_Localized: You squat in the toilet all day until your legs go numb. Still,
      the result is a good one. You feel much more comfortable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687873
    m_Localized: Driving Test 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687874
    m_Localized: "You enter Driving Test 1. A thick book rests on a table. Its cover
      reads \u201CDriving Test 1 Exam Guide.\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687875
    m_Localized: A Little Studying Can't Hurt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687876
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687877
    m_Localized: You pass Driving Test 1. One step closer to your license!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687878
    m_Localized: Skip the Studying. Hit the Road!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687879
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687880
    m_Localized: "After running ten red lights, you are stopped by a traffic officer.
      \u201CAre you trying to get yourself killed?\u201D he roars. He holds out a
      hand for your license. Only then do you realize that you do not have one. He
      kicks you straight back to the washroom. \u201CGo study Driving Test 1!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687881
    m_Localized: No Studying, No Driving! What Can You Do About It?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687882
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687883
    m_Localized: The floor vanishes. You fall with a scream, its echo sounding suspiciously
      like laughter. You land backside-first on a book, breaking your painstakingly
      reassembled bottom into eight pieces again. What, did you expect a reward for
      doing nothing? Dream on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687884
    m_Localized: Square Root of 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687885
    m_Localized: "You enter \u201CSquare Root of 1.\u201D In the middle of the room
      lies a book with nothing on its cover but a large square-root sign. An old
      man with a white face and a red nose sits before it, wailing. \u201CI can't
      understand it!\u201D\n\nHe spots you, leaps forward, and grabs your hand. \u201CYoung
      traveler, help an old man out! What is this?\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687886
    m_Localized: Isn't It a Square-Root Sign?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687887
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687888
    m_Localized: "The old man freezes for a few seconds, then turns bright red. Now
      his nose has company. He kicks you back to the washroom. \u201CObviously! You
      think I don't know it's a square-root sign?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687889
    m_Localized: I Can't Understand It!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687890
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687891
    m_Localized: "The old man freezes, then his face turns green. Red and green.
      Quite the combination. He kicks you into \u201CSquare Root of 2.\u201D \u201CIdiot!
      You're even dimmer than I am! At least I knew it was a square-root sign!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687892
    m_Localized: Are You Trying to Pick a Fight?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687893
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687894
    m_Localized: "The old man does not hesitate. His face darkens with rage. \u201CYaaaaaaah!\u201D
      he bellows in an operatic voice, launching a flying kick that sends you into
      Driving Test 2. Your vision goes black, but his cracked voice still rings in
      your ears. \u201CYou know nothing! This isn't nitpicking! It's devotion to
      mathematics! Devotion!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687895
    m_Localized: Driving Test 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687896
    m_Localized: "You arrive at \u201CDriving Test 2.\u201D However you got here,
      here you are. A car waits on a slope, an examiner in the passenger seat. \u201CManual
      transmission hill start! Stall the engine, lose one hundred points! Touch the
      line, lose one hundred points! Roll back too far, lose one hundred points!
      After stopping\u2026\u201D\n\nYou settle confidently behind the wheel. Years
      of driving have prepared you for any challenge. You reach for the gears, then
      notice something.\nThis car is an automatic!\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687897
    m_Localized: It's an Automatic. What Hill Start?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687898
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687899
    m_Localized: "The furious examiner gets out, drags you from the driver's seat,
      and kicks you back to the washroom. Your newly reassembled bottom breaks into
      eight pieces yet again. As you work on putting it back together, you faintly
      hear him shouting. \u201CYou think I don't know it's an automatic? You think
      I need you to tell me? Who's the examiner here?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687900
    m_Localized: Got It. Just Drive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687901
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687902
    m_Localized: You press the accelerator without hesitation. The car moves off,
      and you complete the entire course smoothly. The examiner stares at you in
      disbelief, then hurriedly gets out, orders you out, and drives away. You watch
      the battered little car disappear with a satisfied smile. Driving Test 2 passed.
      One step closer to a license!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687903
    m_Localized: Wait, I Signed Up for an Automatic-Only License.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687904
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687905
    m_Localized: "The furious examiner gets out and drags you from the driver's seat.
      \u201CWhy don't you just drive down? The reverse-parking section is right there!
      Don't you know this is an automatic? What hill start?\u201D He kicks you through
      the floor, and you land on a book. This time, you had the foresight to bring
      a cushion. Even so, the impact leaves you seeing stars."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687906
    m_Localized: Square Root of 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687907
    m_Localized: "You enter \u201CSquare Root of 2.\u201D However you got here, you
      got here. In the middle of the room lies a book with nothing on its cover but
      a large \u221A2. A green-faced old man sits before it, wailing. \u201CHeavens!
      What can this be?\u201D\n\nHe spots you, leaps forward, and grabs your hand.
      \u201CYoung traveler, help an old man out! What is this?\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687908
    m_Localized: The Cover Says Square Root of Two
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687909
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687910
    m_Localized: "The old man freezes, then flushes bright red with excitement. You
      wonder whether his face was ever green at all. \u201CYes! Exactly! I thought
      it looked like the square root of two! A kindred spirit at last! Our beloved
      \u221A2, so simple in origin, so revolutionary in meaning, so ubiquitous! The
      very emblem of irrational numbers! Mathematics at its finest! You appreciate
      its nobility too, don't you?\u201D\n\nYou can take no more of his raving and
      head for the door marked \u201CSquare Root of 3.\u201D\n\n\u201CThank you,
      young traveler! Let me see you out!\u201D Footsteps pound behind you. Before
      you can turn, a heavy kick lands on your backside. You scream as you fly into
      \u201CSquare Root of 3.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687911
    m_Localized: I Can't Understand It!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687912
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687913
    m_Localized: "The old man freezes for a few seconds, then his nose turns bright
      red. Someone from Gotham suddenly comes to mind. \u201CGet out of here!\u201D
      He kicks you straight back to the washroom. You are amazed that he can aim
      that accurately. \u201CWith brains like those, stick to the driving test next
      time!\u201D he grumbles."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687914
    m_Localized: Back to Gotham. Batman Says He'll Leave You Alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687915
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687916
    m_Localized: "\u201CWhat nonsense! Just say you don't understand! What are you
      babbling about?\u201D The old man grabs your collar and hurls you into \u201CDriving
      Test 3.\u201D You land on your backside in the examination area, surrounded
      by astonished candidates. Looking at the boot print behind you, you feel close
      to tears. \u201CPlease. I'm begging you. No more old men!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687917
    m_Localized: Driving Test 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687918
    m_Localized: "You arrive at \u201CDriving Test 3.\u201D However it happened,
      you finally made it. Another step closer to a license! You rub your hands eagerly.
      A car waits in the examination area, an examiner in the passenger seat. \u201CDriving
      Test 3! Straight-line driving, lane changes, overtaking, U-turns, passing oncoming
      traffic, junctions, night driving, rain and snow, emergency procedures!\u201D\n\nThe
      examiner lowers the window, holds out a hand, and rubs his fingers together.
      You understand at once.\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687919
    m_Localized: Ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687920
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687921
    m_Localized: 'You hand the examiner your ID. He takes it without expression and
      tells you to walk around the car. Your accumulated experience carries you smoothly
      through the test. Smiling, he returns your ID and waves you on to Driving Test
      4.


      You watch the battered little car drive away, feeling thoroughly
      pleased.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687922
    m_Localized: Heh Heh. I Get It!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687923
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687924
    m_Localized: "You hand over your ID and a pack of cigarettes. Before you can
      walk around the car, the examiner storms out and grabs your collar. \u201CYou
      think you can insult me?\u201D He hauls you close and lowers his voice. \u201CThe
      whole test is recorded! Are you trying to ruin me? Next time, hand them over
      before we get here!\u201D\n\n\u201CToo late now. Back to the beginning!\u201D
      He drops you and winds up for an enormous kick. Only then do you recognize
      a former national-team footballer. He's certainly gotten rounder. Too much
      sea cucumber, perhaps\u2026 What are you thinking? That kick is going to hurt!\nToo
      late. He boots you back to the washroom, where you land squarely on the toilet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687925
    m_Localized: What's That Supposed to Mean? I Quit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687926
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687927
    m_Localized: "You explode with anger. When you finish shouting, the examiner
      looks baffled. So do you. Even the battered little car seems baffled. \u201CWhat
      are you on about? I asked for your ID!\u201D he snaps. \u201CThey need an intelligence
      check in that medical exam! Back to school, kid!\u201D He swings his leg, launching
      you into \u201CSquare Root of 4?\u201D\n\nThat hurt! Even with your cushion,
      your bottom has broken into eight pieces. Time to put it back together. Again.
      What rotten luck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687928
    m_Localized: Square Root of 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687929
    m_Localized: "You enter \u201CSquare Root of 3.\u201D However it happened, at
      least you're here. A solitary book lies in the middle of the room, its cover
      marked only with a large \u221A3.\n\nThe room appears empty. Before you can
      relax, a dark-faced old man shouts behind you, nearly scaring you to death.\n\n\u201CHelp
      an old man, young traveler! I never had much schooling, and I can't write this
      essay.\u201D He hands you a sheet of paper. The prompt alone nearly breaks
      you. \u201CLi Hua, a final-year student, has received an assignment from his
      foreign pen pal. Write an essay in English titled \u2018The Lonely Square Root
      of Three,\u2019 in no fewer than 500 words. Li Hua has no ideas. Help him write
      his reply.\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687930
    m_Localized: What Nonsense! Even I Wouldn't Set a Trap Like That!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687931
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687932
    m_Localized: "The old man curses and punches you to the floor. \u201CHow am I
      supposed to hand it in now? Did you ever consider an old man's feelings?\u201D
      You beg for mercy, but he ignores you and kicks you hard in the backside. You
      fly into the Driving Test 4 examination room, where an examiner promptly throws
      you out.\n\n\u201CPlease keep the old men away from me!\u201D you cry to the
      heavens."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687933
    m_Localized: "Write\u2026 Write It Big!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687934
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687935
    m_Localized: "With trembling hands, you take the paper and pen. After two miserable
      hours of chewing your nose and wrestling with the task, your essay is complete.
      The old man finds 499 square roots of two, with a single square root of three
      in the middle.\n\n\u201CBrilliant! Such depth!\u201D He gives you a thumbs-up.
      \u201CNow tell me, how am I supposed to hand this in?\u201D\n\nYou stare blankly.
      His face hardens. He strides over and grabs your collar. \u201CSetting traps
      for an old man! You little scoundrel! Back to cleaning toilets!\u201D\n\nAs
      expected, you return to the washroom. Numbly, you begin reassembling your bottom
      from its eight pieces."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687936
    m_Localized: Li Hua Again? I've Written Enough of His Essays! Let Him Do It!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687937
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687938
    m_Localized: "The old man's already dark face darkens further. \u201CI've written
      Li Hua's essays every day for over seventy years! Who are you to complain?
      You foolish marmot of the Eastern Sea! In the name of God, I'm going to kick
      your backside!\u201D\n\nHe grabs your collar and proceeds to do exactly that.
      You howl in pain, but he is relentless. \u201CWrite the essay, and I'll let
      you go!\u201D\n\nWith no alternative, you diligently finish the assignment.
      He reads 499 square roots of two, followed by a single square root of three
      at the end.\n\n\u201CFine! Fine! Get out!\u201D One mighty kick sends you into
      \u201CSquare Root of 4?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687939
    m_Localized: Driving Test 4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687940
    m_Localized: "You arrive at \u201CDriving Test 4.\u201D However you got here,
      you finally made it. Only one step remains before you earn your license. Eagerly,
      you pick up the book on the desk. Its title is \u201CDriving Test 4 Exam Guide.\u201D\n\nYou
      decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687941
    m_Localized: I Passed Test 1. Why Read This?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687942
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687943
    m_Localized: "You toss the book aside and confidently begin. Of the first 49
      questions, you answer 44 correctly. One more correct answer will get you through.
      Then you read the final question. It is a fill-in-the-blank.\n\u201CWhat is
      the chief examiner's surname?\u201D\nYou overturn the desk in fury. \u201CHow
      should I know?\u201D\n\n\u201CCome back after the waiting period, failure,\u201D
      the chief examiner replies in an eerie voice.\n\nBefore you can argue, he kicks
      you back to the toilet. All that effort, only to end up here again. You hug
      the toilet and weep.\n\nNext time, you plan to study art. Surely the examiner
      wouldn't dare fail you there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687944
    m_Localized: Better Study Anyway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687945
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687946
    m_Localized: "You carefully read the \u201CDriving Test 4 Exam Guide.\u201D Its
      final line puzzles you. \u201CThe chief examiner's surname is Li.\u201D In
      the examination room, the final question asks, \u201CWhat is the chief examiner's
      surname?\u201D Without hesitation, you write \u201CLi,\u201D hand in your paper,
      and pass. You leave in triumph. At last, you can drive legally!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687947
    m_Localized: Same Answer as Test 1. No Studying, No Driving! What Can You Do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687948
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687949
    m_Localized: "You toss the book aside. You have no intention of taking the test.
      Instead, you walk past the chief examiner and straight through the door.\n\n\u201CFinally,
      a door I wasn't kicked through!\u201D It feels wonderful. Even without a reward,
      it feels wonderful!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687950
    m_Localized: Square Root of 4?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687951
    m_Localized: "You enter \u201CSquare Root of 4?\u201D However it happened, you're
      standing here in one piece. A solitary book lies in the middle of the room,
      its cover marked only with a large \u221A4.\n\nThis time, you are careful.
      You circle the room and make absolutely sure there are no old men. None. Not
      one!\n\n\u201CWoo-ha-ha!\u201D A red-faced old man leaps out behind you, nearly
      stopping your heart.\n\nYou clutch your chest in agony. He laughs. \u201CYoung!
      Traveler! Here I am!\u201D\n\nTrembling, you point at the book. \u201CYou can
      understand it, can't you, sir?\u201D\n\n\u201COf course!\u201D He roars with
      laughter. \u201CBut let's see whether you can!\u201D\n\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687952
    m_Localized: I Know!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687953
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687954
    m_Localized: "Confidently, you apply everything you learned from the earlier
      old men. \u201CIt's the square root of four!\u201D\n\nHis already crimson face
      turns as red as a monkey's bottom. \u201CNonsense! What's the square root of
      four? Two! Would you write \u221A4 as the answer to one plus one? You fool!\u201D\n\nYou
      turn pale. Before you can beg for mercy, he takes a running start and kicks
      you back to the toilet. All that work, only to end up here again. You hug the
      toilet and weep.\n\n\u201CHave mercy! I was wrong! Is that not enough?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687955
    m_Localized: Oh, Wait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687956
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687957
    m_Localized: "Confidently, you apply everything you learned from the earlier
      old men. \u201CIt's the\u2014\u201D\n\nWait! Something is wrong! The old man
      is struggling to contain his laughter.\n\n\u201COh! It's two!\u201D You catch
      yourself just in time and give him the answer he wants.\n\n\u201CAh, what a
      shame. This old foot is getting rusty. I was hoping for a little exercise.
      Here, take your reward.\u201D He hands you a cloth bag. Delighted, you accept
      it. At last, you can enter the lounge in comfort.\n\n\u201CAha! A trick! A
      sneak attack!\u201D Pain explodes through your backside, and you rocket into
      the lounge. His final words follow you in a comic singsong.\n\n\u201COnly joking!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687958
    m_Localized: I Don't Understand!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687959
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687960
    m_Localized: "You are close to tears. After all those kicks, you want nothing
      more to do with old men. You just want to escape.\n\nHis eyes widen. \u201CYou
      don't understand? Nonsense! How could you not?\u201D\n\nHe hoists you by the
      collar like a chick. \u201CAnswer me! What is it? Look in my eyes! Tell me,
      why, why baby, why!\u201D\n\nThis old man certainly keeps up with the times.
      You beg for mercy. He prepares to kick you, then discovers that your bottom
      has already broken into eight pieces by itself. \u201CAll right, all right.
      Off you go. I'll let it slide.\u201D He sighs, sets you down, and gives you
      a push. Just as you relax, a kick launches you like a rocket into the lounge.
      You land headfirst before the witch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687961
    m_Localized: Lounge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687962
    m_Localized: "You have reached the lounge. Whether you walked in or flew in,
      you made it. What an achievement! You deserve a cheer!\n\nHooray!\n\nYou look
      up to find the witch who tricked you smiling down at you.\n\n\u201CYou made
      it here on your own merits. Well done. Let's see how you managed it.\u201D\n\nShe
      holds out a hand, expecting you to give her something.\nYou decide\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687963
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 I\u2026 I\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687964
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687965
    m_Localized: "After a moment's hesitation, you hand the witch whatever you can
      think of. She looks it over and shakes her head. \u201CYou didn't get it? Then
      go back and fetch it.\u201D\n\nShe kicks you all the way back to the washroom.
      This time, the flight is so long that your bottom shatters into sixty-four
      pieces.\n\nYou are close to tears. \u201CHow am I supposed to put this back
      together?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687966
    m_Localized: All Right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687967
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687968
    m_Localized: "You hand over proof that you passed Driving Tests 1 through 4.
      The witch examines it and nods approvingly. \u201CVery good! You're officially
      a motorist now. Take your license. Your training is complete!\u201D\n\nYour
      vision blurs. You are back in the real world, still holding the driver's license
      with your photograph inside."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687969
    m_Localized: I've Got It!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687970
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687971
    m_Localized: "Confidently, you hand the witch whatever you can think of. She
      looks it over and shakes her head. \u201CHow can I trust you with this? Without
      the proper documents, you'd endanger yourself and everyone else! Go back and
      do it properly!\u201D\n\nShe kicks you all the way back to the washroom. This
      time, the flight is so long that your bottom shatters into sixty-four pieces.\n\nYou
      are close to tears. \u201CThis is never going to end\u2026\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687972
    m_Localized: Beginner Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687973
    m_Localized: Learn how to explore the map, fight with dice, and develop your
      party.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687974
    m_Localized: Start Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687975
    m_Localized: Main Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687976
    m_Localized: Tutorial Overview
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687977
    m_Localized: Get familiar with exploration, battles, progression, and resource
      management.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687978
    m_Localized: An introduction to the main systems and the order in which you learn
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687979
    m_Localized: Ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687980
    m_Localized: Map Exploration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687981
    m_Localized: Follow routes, recognize important tiles, and get your bearings
      on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687982
    m_Localized: Practice a fixed route with map prompts and highlighted tutorial
      tiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687983
    m_Localized: Planned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687984
    m_Localized: Combat Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687985
    m_Localized: Choose skills, connect targets, resolve clashes, and plan one-sided
      attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687986
    m_Localized: Practice with battle prompts and retry checkpoints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687987
    m_Localized: Planned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687988
    m_Localized: Party Progression
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687989
    m_Localized: Learn how weapons, character growth, healing, and upgrades work
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687990
    m_Localized: Learn to equip weapons and weigh resource costs against rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687991
    m_Localized: Reserved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687992
    m_Localized: Advanced Systems
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687993
    m_Localized: A place for separate lessons on statuses, shops, forging, events,
      and higher difficulties.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687994
    m_Localized: Further lessons can cover each of these systems in more detail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687995
    m_Localized: Reserved
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687996
    m_Localized: Select the enemy itself to inspect it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687997
    m_Localized: Press Prepare to enter target selection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687998
    m_Localized: Select the enemy's speed slot to inspect its skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576687999
    m_Localized: Inspect the enemy's skill, then press Prepare to resolve the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688000
    m_Localized: Prepare to Counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688001
    m_Localized: 'The enemy''s attack is over. Next round, you can intercept it.


      Press
      Prepare again to roll new speed slots.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688002
    m_Localized: Press Prepare to roll the next round's speed slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688003
    m_Localized: Select an ally's speed slot to inspect their skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688004
    m_Localized: Drag from an ally's speed slot to the enemy's speed slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688005
    m_Localized: Connect the speed slots, then press Prepare to resolve the clash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688006
    m_Localized: Prepare the Round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688007
    m_Localized: 'Molly is low on HP, and the enemy''s Execution targets whoever
      has the least HP.


      Press Prepare to roll speed slots for both sides.
      Then inspect what each combatant can do.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688008
    m_Localized: Press Prepare to roll this round's speed slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688009
    m_Localized: Save Your Ally
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688010
    m_Localized: 'Molly is low on HP, and Execution is about to target the weakest
      combatant.


      Select the enemy''s speed slot to see what it plans to use.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688011
    m_Localized: Select the enemy's speed slot to see Execution's target priority.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688012
    m_Localized: Molly's Counter Is Risky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688013
    m_Localized: 'Execution targets the combatant with the lowest HP. Molly has only
      1 HP. If no one intercepts this attack, she''ll probably go down.


      Select
      her speed slot to see whether she can stop it herself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688014
    m_Localized: Select Molly's speed slot to check Light Strike's Power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688015
    m_Localized: Try Connecting Molly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688016
    m_Localized: "Molly's Light Strike rolls at most 2, while Execution rolls 2\u20134.
      She can't reliably win that clash.\n\nDrag from Molly's speed slot to the enemy's
      slot and see who the enemy is targeting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688017
    m_Localized: Connect Molly's speed slot to the enemy's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688018
    m_Localized: Inspect Chara's Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688019
    m_Localized: 'Molly still isn''t safe. See what Chara can do.


      Select
      Chara''s speed slot and inspect Guard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688020
    m_Localized: Select Chara's speed slot to inspect Guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688021
    m_Localized: Redirect with a Faster Ally
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688022
    m_Localized: 'Guard is a defense skill, ideal for intercepting attacks.


      Connect
      Chara''s speed slot to the enemy''s. Because Chara is faster, she can draw
      the attack away from Molly and onto herself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688023
    m_Localized: Connect Chara's speed slot to the enemy's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688024
    m_Localized: Resolve the Round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688025
    m_Localized: 'Execution was aimed at Molly, who has the lowest HP. Faster Chara
      is now taking that attack instead.


      Use faster allies to protect teammates
      from dangerous attacks. Press Prepare to resolve the round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688026
    m_Localized: Connect Guard, then press Prepare to resolve the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688027
    m_Localized: Prepare the Round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688028
    m_Localized: 'This battle teaches skill selection and Energy costs.


      Press
      Prepare to roll this round''s speed slots, then inspect the ally''s available
      skills.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688029
    m_Localized: Press Prepare to roll this round's speed slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688030
    m_Localized: Inspect Allied Skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688031
    m_Localized: Skill choice matters. Select an ally's speed slot to see which skills
      they can use, how much Energy each costs, and what each does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688032
    m_Localized: Open the ally's skill list first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688033
    m_Localized: Switch Skills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688034
    m_Localized: Switch to a different skill. Decide what to use before connecting
      a target. More powerful skills usually cost more Energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688035
    m_Localized: Switch skills once to continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688036
    m_Localized: Connect an Energy-Costing Skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688037
    m_Localized: 'Connecting a skill with an Energy cost spends Energy. You can''t
      use expensive skills if you don''t have enough.


      Your party shares an
      Energy pool. Decide who should use the stronger skills and who can use cheaper
      ones to save Energy. By default, you recover 1 Energy at the start of each
      round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688038
    m_Localized: Connect a skill that costs Energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688039
    m_Localized: Read the Three Effect Triggers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688040
    m_Localized: 'Watch for these triggers in skill descriptions.


      [On Use]
      triggers whenever the skill resolves.

      [On Clash] triggers only in a
      clash.

      [On One-Sided Attack] triggers only when the attack goes through
      without a clash.


      Open an ally''s skill details and read all three.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688041
    m_Localized: Inspect your ally's skill details and read the three effect triggers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688042
    m_Localized: Choose a Skill for Your Plan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688043
    m_Localized: Choose [On Clash] for an attack you intend to intercept. Choose
      [On One-Sided Attack] for an attack you expect to go through unopposed. [On
      Use] is the most reliable when you're unsure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688044
    m_Localized: Switch skills once, then plan the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688045
    m_Localized: Resolve the Round and Observe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688046
    m_Localized: Watch which actions clash and which attacks go through unopposed.
      Compare what happens with the skill's triggers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688047
    m_Localized: Read the effects and switch skills before starting the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688048
    m_Localized: Read Both Enemy Actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688049
    m_Localized: 'This battle combines lessons five and six. Which enemy action is
      faster? Which is more dangerous? Which of your skills is best in a clash, and
      which is best unopposed?


      Inspect both enemy actions before planning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688050
    m_Localized: Inspect the enemy's skills before choosing targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688051
    m_Localized: Switch to a Skill That Fits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688052
    m_Localized: 'Switch skills before starting the round.


      Use [On Clash]
      skills to intercept a high-priority attack. Save [On One-Sided Attack] skills
      for unopposed attacks. [On Use] skills are a safe choice when the outcome is
      unclear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688053
    m_Localized: Switch to a skill that suits your target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688054
    m_Localized: Resolve and Review
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688055
    m_Localized: 'Compare the results with your plan. Did you intercept the faster
      or more dangerous action? Did the skill you picked get the Power bonus you
      were counting on?


      Practice judging Speed, Energy, and effect timing
      together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688056
    m_Localized: Read the enemy's skills and switch skills first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688057
    m_Localized: Plan the Round in Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688058
    m_Localized: 'Put the previous lessons together.

      1. Find the faster enemy
      action that will resolve first.

      2. Identify the more dangerous attack.

      3.
      Choose which skills should clash and which should attack unopposed.

      4.
      Check your Energy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688059
    m_Localized: Inspect the enemy's skills and finish planning the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688060
    m_Localized: Switch Skills Before Resolving
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688061
    m_Localized: Switch skills before resolving the round. Speed determines priority,
      effects tell you when to use each skill, and Energy determines what you can
      afford.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688062
    m_Localized: Switch skills before resolving the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688063
    m_Localized: Resolve the Round and Check Your Plan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688064
    m_Localized: Watch whether your planned clashes and one-sided attacks happen.
      Check that you spent Energy where you intended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688065
    m_Localized: Finish planning before you resolve the round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688066
    m_Localized: Plan the Final Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688067
    m_Localized: 'This is the final practice battle. Make your own plan.

      1.
      Read the enemy''s Speed and actions.

      2. Decide which attacks to intercept
      and which to let through.

      3. Choose the best use for each skill.

      4.
      Check your Energy.


      You''ll see status icons during the fight. Read
      the skills and icons as you would in a regular battle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688068
    m_Localized: Inspect the enemy's skills before starting the final practice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688069
    m_Localized: Start the Final Practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688070
    m_Localized: This time, the guide won't ask for every action. Put everything
      you've learned in the previous battles together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688071
    m_Localized: Finish planning before starting the final practice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688072
    m_Localized: Attack Redirected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688073
    m_Localized: 'The enemy was going to clash with low-HP Molly. Faster Chara took
      over.


      Speed lets you redirect a dangerous attack to someone better
      able to handle it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688074
    m_Localized: Well Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688075
    m_Localized: You learned how Speed redirects attacks. When you see a dangerous
      attack, check who is targeted and see whether a faster ally can take it instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688076
    m_Localized: Well Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688077
    m_Localized: You can now compare allied skills and Energy costs to choose a strategy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688078
    m_Localized: Clash Bonuses Apply Only in Clashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688079
    m_Localized: '[On Clash] effects modify the clash roll. If the winner then rolls
      to deal damage, that bonus does not carry over. [On Use] bonuses apply during
      both the clash and the follow-up hit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688080
    m_Localized: One-Sided Attacks Have Their Own Bonuses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688081
    m_Localized: If your attack goes through unopposed, [On One-Sided Attack] effects
      apply. [On Use] effects still apply. Pick a skill whose triggers match the
      action you expect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688082
    m_Localized: Well Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688083
    m_Localized: You now know when each of the three effects triggers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688084
    m_Localized: Lesson Five Complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688085
    m_Localized: You can now judge Speed, clash targets, Energy, and Power modifiers
      together. You've practiced the two lessons combined in this fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688086
    m_Localized: Faster Enemy Actions Can Change Your Clashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688087
    m_Localized: 'Assigning an ally to clash spends their action to reliably intercept
      an attack. [On Clash] skills are strongest in that situation.


      Prioritize
      a faster enemy action if it could change which clash your ally takes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688088
    m_Localized: Know Which Attacks You Let Through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688089
    m_Localized: Letting a faster or more dangerous action through can cost you,
      especially if it has [On One-Sided Attack] effects. Check each enemy skill's
      triggers before leaving it unopposed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688090
    m_Localized: Speed Helps You Choose What to Protect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688091
    m_Localized: If you want to intercept both actions, start with the faster one
      that resolves first. Weigh Speed together with each skill's effects when you
      choose targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688092
    m_Localized: Plan Your One-Sided Attacks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688093
    m_Localized: Saving an unopposed skill for an open target is a deliberate choice.
      Plan for the bonus before connecting speed slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688094
    m_Localized: Lesson Six Complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688095
    m_Localized: In the final battle, you'll combine Speed, targeting, Energy, and
      skill effects without step-by-step prompts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688096
    m_Localized: Status Effects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688097
    m_Localized: Some skills in this fight apply statuses. Read the skill text and
      inspect unfamiliar icons to see what each status does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688098
    m_Localized: Well Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688099
    m_Localized: You finished the battle tutorial!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688100
    m_Localized: Leave an Opening on Purpose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688101
    m_Localized: When you save an attack for an open target, make sure it benefits
      from [On One-Sided Attack]. Landing a hit means little if you miss the bonus
      you planned for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22781576688102
    m_Localized: Finish the current tutorial prompt first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
